#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), and install pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) into the same directory."
msgstr "Whakaritea he kaupapa tīmatanga mō tētahi papa (mā `@pantoken/scaffold`), ā, tāuta ngā rawa agent o pantoken (mā [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) ki taua kōpaki."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."
msgstr "He [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the scaffold's template files."
msgstr "Te kōpaki whāinga (tautuhinga taunoa `\".\"`). Ko tōna ingoa tūāpapa (rānei `\"pantoken-app\"` mō `\".\"`)\n  ka whakakapi mō `{{projectName}}` i roto i ngā kōnae tauira o te scaffold."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### tool?"
msgstr "### tool?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which agent tool's assets to install alongside the scaffold (default `\"all\"`)."
msgstr "Ko ngā rawa o tēhea taputapu agent hei tāuta i te taha o te scaffold (tautuhinga taunoa `\"all\"`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written, scaffold files first."
msgstr "Ngā ara kua tuhia, tuatahi ngā kōnae scaffold."

