#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: scaffoldProject()"
msgstr "# Mahi: scaffoldProject()"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "Whakaritea he kaupapa tīmata mō tētahi papa, kua tāuta kē a pantoken, ā, kua whakauruhia."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "Te kōpaki whāinga (taunoa `\".\"`). Ko tōna ingoa pūkenga (rānei `\"pantoken-app\"` mō `\".\"`)\n  ka whakakapi mō `{{projectName}}` i ngā kōnae tauira."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### options?"
msgstr "### options?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` e kōwhiri ana i ngā kōnae kua hanga hei pepa tohu `@pantoken/css` ka kawemai (taunoa `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), ā, ka whakatinana puta noa i ngā papa katoa. Ko `cdn` e tīpako ana i te kaiwhakarato CDN; ko ngā `theme.css`/`theme.js` a `canvas-theme-editor` e waihangahia ana (taunoa jsDelivr);\n  kāore e whakaarohia e ētahi atu papa."

