msgid "`@pantoken/next` — a Next.js config adapter."
msgstr "`@pantoken/next` — he taurite whirihinga Next.js."

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure UI ships ESM packages that Next must transpile (`transpilePackages`), the #1 papercut\nwhen running InstUI on Next. `withPantoken` merges the InstUI packages into that list. Wrap your\n`next.config`, then import `@pantoken/css` in your root layout for the tokens."
msgstr "Ka tukuna e Instructure UI ngā mōkī ESM me huri e Next (`transpilePackages`), koinei te raruraru #1\nina whakahaere i te InstUI i runga i Next. `withPantoken` ka whakakotahi i ngā mōkī InstUI ki taua rārangi. Whakapakihia tō\n`next.config`, katahi ka kawemai `@pantoken/css` ki tō tautau pakiaka mō ngā tohu."

