msgstr "Ka tahuri te CSS o tēnei waahanga, ā, ka mahi anō ia i tōna ake; whakakotahitia ki `@pantoken/interactions` kia tāpiri i te whanonga tuitui. Tirohia te [tāblata whakarerekētanga kei raro](#modifiers)."

#: css/avatar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give an image avatar a meaningful `alt` (the person's name), not a generic \"avatar\"; for initials-only avatars, prefer real name content (bare text, data-initials, .name, or .first-name/.last-name) over pre-abbreviated letters, so assistive tech announces the real name."
msgstr "Homai he `alt` whai tikanga ki tētahi avatar whakaahua (te ingoa o te tangata), kaua he \"avatar\" whānui; ki ngā avatar tauākī-tuatahi anake, pai ake te whakamahi i te ingoa tūturu (tuhi mārama, data-initials, .name, rānei .first-name/.last-name) i mua i ngā pūtae kōrero, kia pānuitia te ingoa tūturu e ngā taputapu āwhina."

