msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: banner"
msgstr ""

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-banner` · `alpha` — A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "`.instui-banner` · `alpha` — He mata karere ka taea te kati, he tohu hoki; mō ngā pānui taumata whārangi, ā-roto rānei."

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Size** controls padding and gap: `relaxed` (default) is roomier; `compact` tightens both.\n  **Color** sets the fill: bare (no modifier) is unfilled — border and icon only; `-color-violet`\n  and `-color-sea` add a tinted background plus a matching icon swatch."
msgstr "**Rahi** e whakahaere ana i te padding me te wāhi: `relaxed` (taunoa) he nui ake; `compact` ka whakakīpū i ngā mea e rua.\n  **Tae** ka whakarite i te kī: ko bare (kāore he kaiwhakawhitinga) kāore i kīia — ko te ārai me te tohu anake; `-color-violet`\n  me `-color-sea` ka tāpiri i tētahi papamuri kua tāuruhia me tētahi tauira tohu e hāngai ana."

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `role=\"status\"` (or `role=\"alert\"` for urgent messages) so assistive tech announces the\n  banner; mark a decorative icon `aria-hidden=\"true\"` and give the close button an `aria-label`."
msgstr "Tāpiri i te `role=\"status\"` (rānei `role=\"alert\"` mō ngā karere ohorere) kia whakapuaki ai te hangarau āwhina i te pae; tohu i te tohu whakapaipai hei `aria-hidden=\"true\"` ā hoatu he `aria-label` ki te pātene kati."

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@import \"@pantoken/plugin-custom-components/custom-components.css\";"
msgstr "@import \"@pantoken/plugin-custom-components/custom-components.css\";"

