#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: button"
msgstr ""

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "`.instui-button` — He mana mahi e wātea ana, i āta whakamāramatia mai i te rārangi tohu; matua i te taunoa."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's `.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
msgstr "Ka hurihia e ngā momo AI ngā papaura e rua — he kākahu whakakī padding-box me tētahi tuhi border-box — mō tō rātou anga, ā, kāore e taea e `-color-ai-secondary` te peita i te kuputuhi papura me tētahi whakakī i te wā kotahi, nō reira ka noho mārama tōna pokapū i te wā noho, ā, ka kī i te pāwhiri-kore rānei i te wā pāwhiri. Ko te āhua pā i te `-without-background` me te pāwhiri-kore ka tango i tētahi horoi waitohu āhua iti-porowhita, he paku pouri ake, kāore e whakamahi i ngā tohu papamuri pā-whakamātau raw, ā, ka whakaputa i te kuputuhi-kāhua kotahi-momo i runga i te kotahi-momo. Ka tautuhi hoki i tana ake tohu/tauranga `gap` me te whānui ā-raraunga `padding`; mā te whakauru i tētahi kaiwhakawhakanekehanga wāhanga `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` ka whakawāteahia aua uara ā-tūpono. Ko te `.instui-button-group` takai kōwhiringa e ū ana ki ngā `.buttonGroup` o Figma, ā, ko ia te kaikaute mō te wāhi pāwhiri taha."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drive the `-toggle` variant's pressed state with `aria-pressed`, and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "Whakahaerehia te āhua pēhanga o te tāurunga `-toggle` mā `aria-pressed`, ā, tohuia tētahi pātene kua whakakorehia mā `aria-disabled` (rānei mā te `disabled` taketake)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A group wrapper lays out adjacent buttons with the shared button gap."
msgstr "Ko tētahi takai rōpū ka whakarite i ngā pātene e tata ana ki a rātou me te wāhi pātene tūturu."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An AI action."
msgstr "He mahi AI."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A lower-emphasis AI action."
msgstr "He mahi AI whāiti-uruhanga."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A destructive action."
msgstr "He mahi whakangaromanga."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
