msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A text-style action (no fill or border until hover)."
msgstr "He mahi ā-tūingoa (kahore he whakakī, kahore he taha kia tae rānei ki te pāwhiri)."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter padding for dense toolbars."
msgstr "He whakakākahu koki mō ngā pae taputapu whakahiato."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full-width block button."
msgstr "He pātene poraka-whānui."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-color-tertiary`."
msgstr ""

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a glyph from the icon set before the label (e.g. `-icon-arrow-right`), painted in the button's text colour; pair with `-shape-square`/`-shape-circle` for an icon-only button."
msgstr "Whakarāngia he tohu mai i te kohinga tohu i mua i te taitara (hei tauira `-icon-arrow-right`), kua peita i te tae kuputuhi o te pātene; whakakotahitia ki `-shape-square`/`-shape-circle` mō tētahi pātene tohu-anake."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For a button placed on a coloured (non-neutral) surface. Composed with `-color-primary` (default) fills white with dark text; composed with `-color-secondary` stays transparent with a white border and text."
msgstr "Mō te pātene e whakanoho ana ki runga i tētahi mata tae (kāore he kāpehu). Mēnā ka hangaia me `-color-primary` (taunoa) ka whakakī i te mā me te kuputuhi pango; mēnā ka hangaia me `-color-secondary` ka noho mārama me tētahi taha mā me te kuputuhi mā."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A round icon button."
msgstr "He pātene tohu porowhita."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
