msgid "The AI-secondary gradient border ring, masked to just the button's frame."
msgstr "Te hoopi taha ā-papaura tuarua-AI, i āta tārai kia rite noa ki te anga o te pātene."

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI glyph, added automatically to AI buttons and masked in the variant's own colour."
msgstr "Te tohu AI, tāpiri aunoa ki ngā pātene AI ā, kātahi ka tākai ki te tae o te āhua."

#: css/button.md
