msgid "- [close-button](/api/css/close-button.md) — The icon-only dismiss button."
msgstr "- [close-button](/api/css/close-button.md) — Te pātene whakakore tohu-anake."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: byline"
msgstr ""

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-byline` — A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "`.instui-byline` — He tūemi pāpāho: he āhua ārahi i te taha o tētahi taitara me tētahi whakamārama."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the figure and the text block; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Ka whakarite i tōna ake `gap` i waenganui i te āhua me te poraka kuputuhi; mā te whakakotahi i te `-gap-*` (tautuhinga wāhi) ka whakahē i taua uara ā-tapanga."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [byline.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/byline/byline.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [byline.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/byline/byline.css)"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Vertically centre the text beside the hero."
msgstr "Whakaritea te kuputuhi kia noho ki te pokapū poutū i te taha o te āhua ārahi."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align the text to the top of the hero."
msgstr "Whakaurua te kuputuhi kia ōrite ki te tihi o te āhua ārahi."

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a leading glyph icon before the text block."
msgstr "Whakaatuhia he tōpito tohu glyph i mua i te poraka kuputuhi."

#: css/byline.md
