msgstr ""

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-calendar` — A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "`.instui-calendar` — He rārangi marama tūmau me te whakatere, ngā taitara rā o te wiki, me ngā pūtau rā."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `calendar.day` member for the individual day cells."
msgstr "Tirohia te `calendar.day` mō ngā pūtau rā takitahi."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
