#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Expose the grid with `role=\"table\"` and a descriptive `aria-label`, and give each navigation button its own `aria-label`."
msgstr "Whakakitea te rārangi mā te `role=\"table\"` me tētahi `aria-label` whakamārama, ā, homai ki ia pātene whakatere tōna `aria-label` motuhake."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The seven-column day grid."
msgstr "Te rārangi rā me ngā kolamu e whitu."

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
