#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--display-flex` — Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--display-flex` — Ngā taputapu whakaatu me te whakatikatika kuputuhi — `.--display-<value>` me `.--text-align-<value>` — hei akomanga ā-ao e taea te whakakotahi, ka taea te whakamahi wehe, ka herea rānei ki runga i tētahi wahanga."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets `display: flex`."
msgstr "E tautuhi ana i te `display: flex`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display utilities: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, and `none`."
msgstr "Ngā taputapu whakaatu: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex` me `none`."

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text-alignment utilities: `start`, `center`, `end`, and `justify`."
msgstr "Ngā taputapu whakatikatika kuputuhi: `start`, `center`, `end` me `justify`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: link"
msgstr ""

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-link` — A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "`.instui-link` — He hononga kua hoahoahia, kei roto ngā rahi, he āhuatanga whakarerekē mō ngā papamuri pōuri, ā, he momo ā-raina rānei, he kore-ahua rānei."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own responsive `gap` between an icon and its text (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Ka tautuhi i tōna ake `gap` whakautu i waenga i tētahi ātaahua (icon) me tōna tuhinga (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` e whakarerekē ana i tōna rahi); mā te here i tētahi whakarerekētanga waahi `-gap-*` ka whakawāteahia taua uara ā-taiao."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a disabled link with `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Tohuhia he hononga kua monokia mā te whakamahi i `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For dark backgrounds."
msgstr "Mō ngā papamuri pōuri."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline link, underlined within flowing text."
msgstr "Hononga ā-raina, he raro-raina i waenga i te kuputuhi e rere ana."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Hononga ā-raina nui (ka whakamahia me `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "Hononga ā-raina iti (ka whakamahia me `-inline`)."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Strip link styling: inherit colour, no underline."
msgstr "Tangohia ngā momo āhua hononga: tae tuku iho, kāore he raro-raina."

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — A breadcrumb trail is built from links; also its small-screen fallback (pair with the `responsive` utility to swap Breadcrumb for a Link below ~768px)."
msgstr "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — He ara breadcrumb i hangaia i ngā hononga; koinei hoki tōna whakarerekētanga mō ngā mata iti (whakaritea me te taputapu `responsive` kia huri ai te Breadcrumb hei Link i raro i te ≈768px)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — He tūemi rārangi (InstUI `List.Item`)."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `list`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, and `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` modifiers restyle this member — see `list`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Ko ngā kaitauturi `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, me `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` o te mātua `list` e whakarerekē i te āhua o tēnei mema — tirohia ngā tuhinga a `list` mō ēnā kaitauturi."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a dashed rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Wahia ngā tūemi mā te ture raina ā-aukati. @affects list.item — Tāpirihia te ture wehenga i waenga i ngā tūemi."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a solid rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "Wahia ngā tūemi mā te ture raina totoka. @affects list.item — Tāpirihia te ture wehenga i waenga i ngā tūemi."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ordered-list numbering. @affects list.item — Adds marker weight and indentation."
msgstr "Tatau o te rārangi raupapa. @affects list.item — Tāpirihia te taumaha tohu me te whakanoho."

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the list bullet or ordered-list number."
msgstr "Ka whakaatu i te pōturi rārangi, i te tau rānei o te rārangi raupapa."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — He rārangi me te wāhi tūemi e ārahi ana e ngā tohu."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `padding-inline-start` for list indentation; chaining a `-p*`/`-padding*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value. See the `list.item` member for the individual items."
msgstr "Ka tautuhia tōna ake `padding-inline-start` mō te urunga rārangi; mā te hono i tētahi kaitautoko wāhi `-p*`/`-padding*` ka whakawētea taua uara ā-taunoa. Tirohia te mema `list.item` mō ngā tūemi takitahi."

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"

