#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: mask"
msgstr ""

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "`.instui-mask` — He papanga i roto i te rerenga e kī ana i tōna mātua kua whakatakotoria, ā, ka whakakotahi i ōna ihirangi ki te pokapū — hei tauira, he tohu hurihuri kei runga i tētahi kāri. Mō tētahi mōhiti, he pai ake te whakamahi i te `<dialog>` taketake (ko tōna `::backdrop` te māsku). Kei ia kotahi o ēnei whakatikatika he whakaaturanga ā-ao anō hoki (mā te ingoa anake, rānei ka herea ki tētahi atu wāhanga) — titiro ki te taputapu ā-ao `mask`."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."
msgstr "Whakakakarakarahia ngā mea kei muri o te māsku mā te whakamahi i te backdrop-filter."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."
msgstr "Kua āta tū ki te matapihi tirohanga, e kapi ana i taua wāhi, ā, kei runga i te taumata z-index teitei."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: maskglobal"
msgstr ""

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "`.--mask-overlay` — He kape takirua, ā-ao o ngā whakarereketanga overlay o te wāhanga `mask` — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — ka taea te whakamahi māhā, mā te hono rānei ki runga i tētahi wāhanga, kāore e hiahiatia te whakakakahu ki roto i tētahi tūemi `.instui-mask`."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."
msgstr "Te papanga ārai katoa (tūnga, whakakōtahi/pokapū, papamuri)."

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.group"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.group"

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.group` — A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "`.group` — He taitara rōpū kua tapaina (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "`.item` — He kupu rārangi tahua (InstUI `Menu.Item`); tāpirihia -disabled, -highlighted, rānei -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a checked item with `aria-checked=\"true\"` (same styling as `-active`)."
msgstr "Tohu he tūemi kua tīpakohia ki `aria-checked=\"true\"` (he āhua rite ki `-active`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Active/checked highlight; same styling as `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Whakakā/whakaatu mō tū/tuhi kua tīpakohia; he āhua rite ki `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Muted, non-interactive."
msgstr "Whakaitihia, kāore e pāhekoheko."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlighted background/text (keyboard focus or hover)."
msgstr "Papamuri/tuhi kua whakanikoniko (aro papapātuhi rānei hover)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary info text within the item."
msgstr "Kuputuhi mōhiohio tuarua i roto i te tūemi."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu"
msgstr "# CSS: menu"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-menu` — A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "`.instui-menu` — He mata taka-iho o ngā tūemi, ngā rōpū, me ngā wehenga."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compose entries as `.item` (see the `menu.item` member), label a section with `.group` (see `menu.group`), and divide sections with `.separator` (see `menu.separator`)."
msgstr "Hangaia ngā tomokanga hei `.item` (tīmatahia te tiro ki te mema `menu.item`), tapaina tētahi wāhanga ki te `.group` (tīmatahia te tiro ki `menu.group`), ā, wehehia ngā wāhanga mā te `.separator` (tīmatahia te tiro ki `menu.separator`)."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tree-browser](/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."
msgstr "- [tree-browser](/mi/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/mi/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.separator"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.separator"

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.separator` — A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "`.separator` — He ture wehenga i waenga i ngā tūemi (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: metric"
msgstr ""

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-metric` — A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "`.instui-metric` — He tatauranga kua tapaina — he uara nui kei runga i tētahi kupu whakamārama."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the value and label, and its own horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values."
msgstr "E tautuhia ana tōna ake `gap` i waenga i te uara me te tapanga, me tōna ake ā-whakapae `padding`; mā te hono i tētahi tautuhinga wāhi (`-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*`) ka whakakāhore i aua uara taunoa."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Centre the value and label."
msgstr "Whakakotahitia te uara me te tapanga ki te pokapū."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the value and label."
msgstr "Whakatakotoria te uara me te tapanga kia whakamutunga."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the value and label."
msgstr "Whakatakotoria te uara me te tapanga kia tīmata."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caption beneath the value."
msgstr "Te kupu whakamārama kei raro iho o te uara."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The large metric number."
msgstr "Te tau metirika nui."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.body"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.body"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `&lt;img&gt;` goes full-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Ko ngā whakarerekētanga `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, me `-color-inverse` o te matua `modal` e whakahōu ana i te āhua o tēnei mema — titiro ki ngā tuhinga a `modal` mō aua whakarerekētanga."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.footer"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.footer"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — Te rārangi mahi (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Ko ngā kaiwhakarerekē `-density-compact` me `-color-inverse` o te matua `modal` e whakahou i te āhua o tēnei mema — tirohia te tuhinga ake o `modal` mō aua kaiwhakarerekē."

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.header"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.header"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.header` — The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "`.header` — Te rārangi taitara (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal"
msgstr ""

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — He mata kōrerorero (mahi ki te &lt;dialog&gt; taketake); ngā wāhanga upoko/tinana/wāhanga whakamutunga."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Tirohia ngā mema `modal.header`, `modal.body`, me `modal.footer` mō ia wāhanga."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "Whakatuwheratia te `<dialog>` taketake me te `showModal()` mō ngā tikanga modal me te pēhitanga Esc ki te kati, ā, ingoaia me te `aria-labelledby` e tohu ana ki te `.header`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "Whakapōrearea te papamuri kei muri o te modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "Chrome mō ngā papamuri pouri (tae atu ki te tinana pāpāho). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Ka huri i ngā tae o ia wāhanga mō te āhua pouri."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "Whakatītina ngā tāpiri o ia wāhanga. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Ka whakatītina ngā tāpiri o ia wāhanga."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "Whakarite ki te matapihi tirohanga, ā, whakamauhia te tinana kia huri. @affects modal.body — Ka huri te tinana ina kua herea te modal ki te matapihi tirohanga."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "Rahi ki te ihirangi."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "Mai-pito ki te pito."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "He modal whānui. He ingoa roa mō `-size-lg`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "He modal whānui."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "He modal angiangi."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "He modal angiangi. He ingoa roa mō `-size-sm`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "Ka mārama-iti te whārangi kei muri i te kōrero hei papanga māhanga (mask), ā, ka whakakōrākora rānei i raro i `-blur`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- Ka hoahoa i te &lt;dialog&gt; taketake me tōna `::backdrop`; me te kaitirotiro tukutuku e tautoko ana i te āhuatanga dialog mō te whakairo paparanga runga me te āhua papamuri."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — He tauira ārai ka taea te katia te tray, kua herea ki tētahi taha o te mata."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: number-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — He anga tāuru-nama me te pou hurihuri +/-."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."
msgstr "He `aria-hidden` ngā pātene `.arrows`, ā he whakaaturanga noa — ko te whakanui/whakaiti i te uara i te pā he mahi JS a te kaihoko hei hono."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Put the accessible name on the `<input>` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Tāpiri i te ingoa whai wāhi ki te `<input>` (hei tauira `aria-label`) kia te mara e whai mana ana ki te uara; he whakapaipai ngā pātene hurihuri +/- ā ka tohuhia hei `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium."
msgstr "(taunoa) Waenga."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "(taunoa) Waenga. He ingoa roa atu mō `-size-md`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The +/- spinner column at the inline-end."
msgstr "Te pou hurihuri +/- kei te mutunga ā-raina."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decrement button; the unclassed button increments."
msgstr "Te pātene whakaheke; ko te pātene kāore i te kara e whakanui ana."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked chevron glyph on each spinner button: up to increment, down on `.down`."
msgstr "Te tohu chevron huna ki runga i ia pātene hurihuri: piki mō te whakanui, he heke i runga i `.down`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same input facade chrome.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — Another numeric input control."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — He rite te anga kanohi o te tāuru.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — He atu mana whakahaere tāuru tau."

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: overflow"
msgstr ""

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--overflow-x-hidden` — `overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--overflow-x-hidden` — `overflow-x`/`overflow-y` hei kara ā-ao e taea te whakakotahi — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — ka taea te whakamahi mokemoke, te here rānei ki ngā wāhanga katoa."

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/overflow/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/overflow/index.ts)"

