#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: page-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Rārangi whārangi paetaha-toru paerewa me te taitara, te taha-whārangi, me te ihirangi matua."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "✅ Whakamahia te Page-Layout i ngā wā e whai ake nei:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a classic page structure with navigation and content areas\n- The page has a clear main content area flanked by complementary regions\n- You want consistent spacing and alignment across the layout\n🚫 Don't use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "- Me hiahia koe i tētahi hanganga whārangi tuku iho me ngā wāhi whakatere me ngā wāhi ihirangi\n- He wāhi ihirangi matua mārama kei te whārangi, ā, kei ngā taha ētahi wāhi tautoko\n- Kei te hiahia koe kia ū, kia taurite ngā mokowā me te rāranga puta noa i te whakarōpūtanga\n🚫 Kaua e whakamahi i te Page-Layout mēnā:"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a single-column page — use a simpler layout instead\n- The sidebar competes with main content for importance"
msgstr "- Kei te hanga whārangi kotahi-kolamu — whakamahia he whakarōpūtanga māmā ake\n- Kei te whakataetae te taha-whārangi ki te ihirangi matua mō te hiranga"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a `<main>` landmark\n- Give the sidebar `role=\"navigation\"` or `role=\"complementary\"` as appropriate\n- Ensure landmark regions have distinct aria-labels"
msgstr "- Whāngaihia te wāhi ihirangi matua ki tētahi tūāpapa `<main>`\n- Homai ki te taha-whārangi he `role=\"navigation\"`, he `role=\"complementary\"` rānei, kia hāngai\n- Me whakarite kia rerekē ngā aria-label o ngā rohe tūāpapa"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main body containing sidebar and content."
msgstr "Te tinana matua e kapi ana i te taha-whārangi me te ihirangi."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom footer region."
msgstr "Rohe whakararo (footer)."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top header region."
msgstr "Rohe taitara o runga (header)."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Central content area."
msgstr "Wāhi ihirangi pokapū."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left navigation or auxiliary column."
msgstr "Kolamu mauī mō te whakatere, mō ētahi āwhina rānei."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pagination"
msgstr ""

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pagination` — Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "`.instui-pagination` — Whakawhiti whārangi: whārangi nama, pere tuatahi, o mua, o muri, me te whakamutunga, me te tohu ... mō ngā wāhi wehe."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `pagination.page` member for the individual page controls."
msgstr "Tirohia te mema `pagination.page` mō ngā mana whārangi takitahi."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label, mark the current page with aria-current=\"page\", give each arrow an aria-label, and disable end arrows with disabled or aria-disabled=\"true\"."
msgstr "Whakapaia te `<nav>` ki te aria-label, tohu te whārangi o nāianei me aria-current=\"page\", whakarite aria-label ki ia pere, ā, whakakorehia ngā pere mutunga mā te disabled, mā rānei te aria-disabled=\"true\"."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render arrow glyph icons inside the first/prev/next/last controls."
msgstr "Whakaatuhia ngā tohu (glyph) pere i roto i ngā mana tuatahi/mua/muri/mutunga."

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compact variant with a page-number input."
msgstr "Putanga paku me te momo urunga tau whārangi."

#: css/pagination.md
