msgstr "Te whārangi o nāianei; he āhua ano ki `[aria-current]`."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pill"
msgstr ""

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pill` — A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "`.instui-pill` — He tapanga tūnga paku; tāpirihia he āhuahua ārahi mā te anga āwhiwhiwhi `-icon-<name>`."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Unlike `badge`, which shows a count, or `tag`, which is removable, the pill is a static status label; its leading glyph is a masked `::before`, not an `<img>`."
msgstr "He rereke i te `badge` e whakaatu ana i te tatauranga, me te `tag` e taea te tango; ko te pill he tapanga tūnga pūmau; ko tōna āhuahua ārahi he `::before` kua ārai, ehara i te `<img>`."

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
