#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — A badge is the count or notification counterpart.\n- [tag](/api/css/tag.md) — A tag is the removable, form-oriented counterpart."
msgstr "- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — He tohu te badge mō te tatauranga, te pānui rānei.\n- [tag](/api/css/tag.md) — He tapanga te tag e taea te tango, ā, he hāngai ki ngā puka."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: popover"
msgstr ""

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-popover` — An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "`.instui-popover` — He mata teitei mō te `[popover]` taketake, kua whakanohoia mā te tūnga punga CSS."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Anchor positioning is Chromium-only; the `@supports` guard means `-placement-*` is silently inert elsewhere and the UA centers the popover in the top layer instead of failing."
msgstr "He tikanga Chromium-anake te tūnga punga; e tohu ana te kaitiaki `@supports` ka noho āta-tū ki te `-placement-*` i ērā atu wāhi, ā, ka whakanohohia e te UA te popover ki te paparanga runga i te pokapū, kaua e hē."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [popover.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/popover/popover.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [popover.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/popover/popover.css)"

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Uses CSS anchor positioning (`position-anchor`/`position-area`) and the native `[popover]` API, both Chromium-only today; an `@supports` guard keeps the placement inert elsewhere, where the UA centres the popover in the top layer."
msgstr "- Ka whakamahi i te tūnga punga CSS (`position-anchor`/`position-area`) me te API taketake `[popover]`, e rua nei mō Chromium anake i tēnei wā; ko te kaitiaki `@supports` ka pupuri i te tūnga kia kore e mahi i ētahi atu wāhi, ā, i reira ka whakanohoia e te UA te popover ki te paparanga runga i te pokapū."

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — A tooltip is a smaller, hover- or focus-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Context view is a related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — He tooltip he mata iti, ka puta i te wā e pāhia ana te tohu (hover) rānei ka aro ki tētahi mea (focus).\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — He context view he mata hono punga, e hono ana hoki ki tētahi maka tohu (pointer)."

