msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate the meter, ring, and centered value into place on mount."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default)."
msgstr "Waenganui (taunoa)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "Waenganui (taunoa). He ingoa roa mō `-size-md`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text centred in the ring's hole."
msgstr "Te kuputuhi uara kei waenganui i te rua o te mekameka."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; spins `::before` at a fixed arc and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Whakaritea, kāore i te wāhanga o InstUI. Ka hāngai anake ki te `<progress>` taketake kāore he āhuatanga `value`; ka hurihia `::before` i tētahi ārewa pūmau ā, ka huna `.value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the ring itself: a conic-gradient donut clipped with a radial mask, whose arc tracks the `--value` custom property."
msgstr "E tā te rīngi anō: he donut rehi-conic kua tapahia ki tētahi ārai radial, ā, ko tōna ārewa e whai ana i te rawa ritenga `--value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds to wait before starting the mount animation (default `0`)."
msgstr "Ngā hēkona kia tatari i mua i te tīmata o te whakatītaha whakaurunga (taunoa `0`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "Te uara teitei rawa mō te ahu whakamua (taunoa `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The minimum meter value (default `0`)."
msgstr "Te uara iti rawa mō te mita (taunoa `0`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled arc (meter) colour; the -color-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Te tae o te ārewa kapi (te mita); ko ngā kaitautoko -color-* e tautuhi ana."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ring's stroke width; the -size-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Te whānui o te tohu o te mekameka; ko ngā kaitautoko -size-* e tautuhi ana."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unfilled track colour."
msgstr "Te tae ara kāore i kapi."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value; registered with @property so it can transition."
msgstr "Te uara ahu whakamua o nāianei; kua rehitatia ki @property kia taea te whakawhitinga."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias {@link --max} The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "@alias {@link --max} Te uara teitei rawa mō te ahu whakamua (taunoa `100`)."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias Alias for `--value`."
msgstr "@alias Ingoa pānui mō `--value`."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Registers the numeric progress properties with `@property` and paints with CSS `mask` and `conic-gradient`; where custom-property transitions are unsupported the ring still renders but won't animate."
msgstr "- Rehitatia ngā rawa tau ā-nomera ki `@property` ā, ka peita mā ngā CSS `mask` me `conic-gradient`; mēnā kāore ngā whakawhitinga rawa ritenga e tautokohia ka whakaatu tonu te rīngi engari kāore e neke."

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — The linear bar form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — Te ahua pae tapawhā o te ahu whakamua taurite."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: progress"
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — He pae ahunga whakamua tauine me tētahi mita tae, ngā rahi, me tētahi tūtohu uara kōwhiringa."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.value` is a sibling of `.bar`, both children of the root — mirroring how progress-circle nests its own `.value` part. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), animating `.bar` as a sliding segment and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "`.value` he teina rānei mā `.bar`, e rua ngā tamariki o te pakiaka — e tohu ana i te āhua e ngutu ana te progress-circle i tōna ake wāhanga `.value`. Kāore ā InstUI he āhuatanga kore-tau; ko `:indeterminate` he whakapae pai anake ā-pantoken (native `<progress>` me te kore āhuatanga `value`), ka whakaorite i `.bar` hei wahi kauhoe ka huna i `.value` nā te kore he tau whai tikanga hei whakaatu. Kāore he āhuatanga kore-tau ā `<meter>`, nō reira kāore e pāngia."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders `.value` inside the track, aligned to its start, instead of beside it; style it for legibility over the meter colour."
msgstr "Ka whakaatu i `.value` i roto i te ara, kua tohua ki tōna tīmatanga, hei tāpiri atu ki tāna taha; āta hoahoa kia mārama te pānui ki runga i te tae o te mita."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate meter changes over half a second."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled meter bar."
msgstr "Te pae mita kua kī."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text beside the bar."
msgstr "Te kuputuhi uara kei te taha o te pae."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; animates `.bar` as a sliding segment and hides `.value`."
msgstr "Whakaritea, ehara i te wāhanga o InstUI. Ka tika mō tētahi native `<progress>` kāore i a ia te āhuatanga `value`; ka whakaorite i `.bar` hei wahi kauhoe ka huna i `.value`."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the track's bottom rule as its own layer over the meter, so the full border and the bottom border stay independent across themes."
msgstr "Ka tuhi i te ture raro o te ara hei paparanga motuhake ki runga i te mita, kia noho motuhake te huinga porowhita me te ture raro puta noa i ngā kaupapa kaupapa (themes)."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value."
msgstr "Te uara ahunga whakamua o nāianei."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Scopes the meter part rules with the `@scope` at-rule; browsers without `@scope` support ignore those scoped rules."
msgstr "- Ka tāwhai i ngā ture wāhanga mita ki te ture-ā-`@scope`; ka whakakorehia e ngā pūtirotiro kāore e tautoko ana i `@scope` aua ture kua tāwhai."

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — The circular form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — Ko te āhua porowhita o taua pae ahunga whakamua tauine."

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: prose"
msgstr "# CSS: prose"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`:where(body)` — Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "`:where(body)` — Ngā tautuhinga ā-taipō taunoa mō te HTML matau — ngā taitara, ngā para, ngā rārangi, ngā hono, me te waehere — ka tau aunoa ki ngā wāhi katoa e kawemai ana (taunoa `:where(body)`); tuku `options.scope` kia hāngai ki tētahi pakiaka ihirangi rerekē (hei tauira `.vp-doc`)."

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio-input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio-input-group` — A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`.instui-radio-input-group` — He pātene irirangi kōwhiri kotahi `<fieldset>`, noa rānei, kāore rānei i hono hei pana wāhanga."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between radios; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Ka tautuhi i tōna ake `gap` i waenga i ngā pātene irirangi; mā te here i tētahi kaitahuri āwhina wāhanga `-gap-*` ka whakakapi i taua uara ā-tuhi."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>` that names the group; the child radios share one `name`, so only one can be selected at a time."
msgstr "Ka whakaatu i tētahi `<fieldset>` taketake me tētahi `<legend>` e ingoa ana i te rōpū; ka tiri ngā pātene irirangi tamariki i tētahi `name` kotahi, nō reira kotahi anake te wā ka taea te kōwhiri."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Toggle variant"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out in columns."
msgstr "Whakanohoia ngā pātene irirangi ki roto i ngā pou."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out inline."
msgstr "Whakanohoia ngā pātene irirangi ki runga i te raina kotahi."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the child toggles out as a segmented control (only the selected segment fills)."
msgstr "Whakanohoia ngā pana tamariki hei mana wāhanga (ko te wāhanga kua tīpakohia anake e kapi)."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The individual control this group collects.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — The general wrapper for grouping and laying out fields."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — Te mana takitahi e kohia ana e tēnei rōpū.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Te kopa whānui mō te whakarōpū me te whakanoho i ngā wāhanga."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio` — A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "`.instui-radio` — He pātene iraruke taketake me tōna tūāhua."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Ka whakaritea tōna ake `gap` i waenganui i te mana whakahaere me tōna tūāhua; mā te here i tētahi kaiwhakatika āwhina wāhi `-gap-*` ka whakawāteahia taua uara ā-taonga."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"radio\">` drives `:checked` and `:disabled`; `-readonly` is styling only, since radios have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "Ko tētahi `<input type=\"radio\">` taketake e whakakaha ana i te `:checked` me te `:disabled`; he whakakākahu anake te `-readonly`, nā te kore o ngā iraruke i tētahi āhuatanga readonly taketake."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Tae horopaki mōrearea (putanga whakawhiti)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Off/neutral context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Tae horopaki whakaweto/tautono (putanga whakawhiti)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Tae horopaki angitū (putanga whakawhiti)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "Tae horopaki whakatūpato (putanga whakawhiti)."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-variant-toggle`."
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a segmented toggle button."
msgstr "Whakaatuhia hei pātene whakawhiti wāhanga."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled inner dot shown when checked; on `-variant-toggle` it is the focus ring drawn just outside the pill."
msgstr "Te porowhita ā-roto kīkī e whakaatuhia ana ina kua tohu; i runga i te `-variant-toggle` koinei te porowhita arotahi ka tuhia tonu i waho o te pīhanga."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle's selected fill colour; the -context-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "Te tae kī kua tīpakohia mō te whakawhiti; ko ngā kaiwhakatikatika -context-* e tautuhi ana."

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — The multi-select counterpart to a single-select radio.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Collects radios into one single-select fieldset."
msgstr "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — Te hoa maha-tīpako ki tētahi iraruke kotahi-tīpako.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — E kohikohi ana i ngā iraruke ki tētahi huinga papa kotahi-tīpako."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: range-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-range-input` — A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "`.instui-range-input` — He rārangi hurihuri kua whakairohia me tētahi pāpū uara whakamuri."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each vendor thumb/track pseudo-element needs its own separate rule — grouping them in one selector list would invalidate the whole rule in browsers that don't recognize the other vendor's pseudo."
msgstr "Me whai ture motuhake tō ia pseudo-element mō te \"thumb\"/\"track\" o ia kaiwhakarato — ko te whakarōpū i a rātou ki tētahi rārangi kōwhiringa kotahi ka whakakahore i te ture katoa i ngā kaitirotiro kāore e mōhio ki te pseudo o tētahi atu kaiwhakarato."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control is a native `<input type=\"range\">`; give it an accessible name with `aria-label` or an associated `<label>`."
msgstr "He `<input type=\"range\">` taketake te mana whakahaere; homai he ingoa whai wātea māna mā te `aria-label`, mōhio rānei ki tētahi `<label>` hono."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the value bubble's caret, a small triangle pointing back toward the track."
msgstr "Kei te tuhi i te karet o te pāpū uara, he tokotoru iti e tohu ana ki tua ki te ara."

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The typed numeric-entry counterpart."
msgstr "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Te hoa tārite mō te whakauru tau mā te pato."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rating"
msgstr ""

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-rating` — A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "`.instui-rating` — He whakatauranga whetū me ngā tohu whetū kī me ngā tohu whetū kore, ā, he tapanga tau kōwhiringa."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between star glyphs; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Ka tautuhia tōna ake `gap` i waenga i ngā tohu whetū; ka whakakapi taua uara kua whakaurua mēnā ka herea he whakarerekētanga āwhina mokowā `-gap-*`."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give it role=\"img\" and an aria-label stating the rating, since the stars are icon glyphs."
msgstr "Homai ki a ia te role=\"img\" me tētahi aria-label e kī ana te whakatauranga, nō te mea he tohu ata ngā whetū."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render star glyphs with icon classes (for example, `-icon-star-solid`)."
msgstr "Whakaatuhia ngā tohu whetū mā ngā kara icon (hei tauira, `-icon-star-solid`)."

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The numeric label, e.g. \"3/5\"."
msgstr "Te tapanga tau, ara, \"3/5\"."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: responsive"
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Ngā kara huna/wātea ā-whānui-tirohanga rānei ā-ipu i roto i te rēreti tapawhā tōpū."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` hide by viewport width; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` are the inverse (hidden by default, shown only inside the range via `display: revert`); the `-cq-` variants react to a `.instui-container` ancestor's width instead, not the viewport's. Scale tiers `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (sourced from the IR's tray-width component tokens) are each aliased to a long-form spelling (`x-small`–`x-large`) and a device name (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — both deprecated in favor of the short name — plus the unscaled, themed `content`/`content-full-width` tiers (the main content area's max-width)."
msgstr "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` ka huna mā te whānuitanga tirohanga; ko `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` te whakahē (kua huna mā te taunoa, ka whakaatuhia anake i roto i te awhi mā `display: revert`); ko ngā momo `-cq-` ka urupare ki te whānui o tētahi tūpuna `.instui-container`, ehara i te whānuitanga tirohanga. Ko ngā wāhanga rahi `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (i ahu mai i ngā tohu wā-whānui o te IR) kua whakatūturuhia ki te āhua roa (`x-small`–`x-large`) me te ingoa pūrere (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — kua tuku iho ēnei ki te whakamahi i te ingoa pōtiki — me ngā taumata kāore i te whakatōpū, ā-tāroaro `content`/`content-full-width` (te whānuitanga mōrahi o te wāhanga ihirangi matua)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `content` breakpoint (`68.75em`)."
msgstr "Huna mēnā kei te taumata `content` te ipu kua tohu, kei raro rānei (`68.75em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `content-full-width` breakpoint (`98.75em`)."
msgstr "Huna mēnā kei te taumata `content-full-width` te ipu kua tohu, kei raro rānei (`98.75em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-xl`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-lg`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `lg` breakpoint (`48em`)."
msgstr "Huna mēnā kei te taumata `lg` te ipu kua tohu, kei raro rānei (`48em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `md` breakpoint (`30em`)."
msgstr "Huna mēnā kei te taumata `md` te ipu kua tohu, kei raro rānei (`30em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-md`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-xs`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-cq-hidden-max-sm`."
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `sm` breakpoint (`20em`)."
msgstr "Huna mēnā kei te taumata `sm` te ipu kua tohu, kei raro rānei (`20em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hide when the marked container is at or below the `xl` breakpoint (`62em`)."
msgstr "Huna mēnā kei te taumata `xl` te ipu kua tohu, kei raro rānei (`62em`)."

#: css/responsive.md
