msgid "Show (inverse of `-hidden-max-xs`) when the viewport is at or above the `xs` breakpoint (`16em`); hidden otherwise."
msgstr "Whakaatu (te whakawāhanga o `-hidden-max-xs`) ina kei te taumata wehenga `xs` te matapihi tirohanga, i runga rānei (`16em`); ā, ka huna i ērā atu."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `content` breakpoint's value (`68.75em`, hand-authored, themed (not in the token IR)). Overriding it does not move the compiled `@media`/`@container` thresholds above."
msgstr "Ko te uara o te taumata wehenga `content` (`68.75em`, i tuhia ā-ringa, kua āhua-mātiti (kāore i roto i te token IR)). Kāore te whakamāori ake i tēnei e neke ai ngā paearu kua whakakotahihia `@media`/`@container` ki runga."

#: css/responsive.md
