msgid "The `content-full-width` breakpoint's value (`98.75em`, hand-authored, themed (not in the token IR)). Overriding it does not move the compiled `@media`/`@container` thresholds above."
msgstr "Ko te uara o te taumata wehenga `content-full-width` (`98.75em`, i tuhia ā-ringa, kua āhua-mātiti (kāore i roto i te token IR)). Kāore te whakamāori ake i tēnei e neke ai ngā paearu kua whakakotahihia `@media`/`@container` ki runga."

