msgid "The `lg` breakpoint's value (`48em`, mirrors `--instui-component-tray-width-lg`). Overriding it does not move the compiled `@media`/`@container` thresholds above."
msgstr "Ko te uara o te taumata wehenga `lg` (`48em`, e ōrite ana ki `--instui-component-tray-width-lg`). Kāore te whakamāori ake i tēnei e neke ai ngā paearu kua whakakotahihia `@media`/`@container` ki runga."

