msgstr "Ko te uara o te taumata wehenga `md` (`30em`, e ōrite ana ki `--instui-component-tray-width-md`). Kāore te whakamāori ake i tēnei e neke ai ngā paearu kua whakakotahihia `@media`/`@container` ki runga."

