#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rubric-note"
msgstr ""

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — Tuhipoka hanganga me ngā kāwai paearu me ngā tohu mō te tohu."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "✅ Whakamahia Rubric-Note ina:"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying grading rubric or assessment criteria\n- You need to structure content by category with scores or indicators\n- The layout should emphasize structure and hierarchy\n🚫 Don't use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "- E whakaatu ana i te paearu aromatawai\n- Me whakarite te ihirangi mā ngā kāwai me ngā tohu\n- Me whakakī te whakaaturanga ki te hanganga me te tūmataiti\n🚫 Kaua e whakamahi Rubric-Note ina:"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying simple notes or comments — use Callout instead\n- Complex grading logic is needed — consider a custom component"
msgstr "- E whakaatu ana i ngā tuhipoka ngawari rānei he kōrero — whakamahia Callout kē\n- E hiahiatia ana he arorau tohu matatini — whakaaro ki tētahi waahanga ritenga"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use table semantics if displaying a true rubric with rows and columns\n- Ensure score indicators are not color-only\n- Provide descriptive labels for each category"
msgstr "- Whakamahia ngā tikanga ripanga mēnā he paearu tūturu kei roto i ngā rārangi me ngā pou\n- Me whakarite kāore ngā tohu tohu e tae anake (kāore kia tae-tae anake)\n- Whakaratohia he tapanga whakamārama mō ia kāwai"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for rubric criteria rows."
msgstr "Ipu mō ngā rārangi paearu."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Detailed description of the criterion."
msgstr "Whakamārama taipitopito mō te paearu."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Header with title and metadata."
msgstr "Upoko me te taitara me ngā raraunga meta."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Criterion name or category."
msgstr "Ingoa paearu, arā, kāwai."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Individual criterion row."
msgstr "Rārangi paearu takitahi."

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Score indicator or badge."
msgstr "Tohu tohu, pākete rānei."

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: screen-reader-content"
msgstr "# CSS: screen-reader-content"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — Huna ā-visual i te ihirangi, engari kia wātea tonu ki ngā hangarau āwhina (te tauira tapahi paerewa)."

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keeps text in the accessibility tree for screen readers while removing it from the visual layout."
msgstr "Ka waiho te kuputuhi i roto i te rākau ā-āhei mō ngā kaipānui mata, ā, ka tangohia i te whakatakotoranga ā-visual."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.item` — He tomokanga whakatere (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); ko `-selected` e tohu i te mea e mahi ana."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `side-nav-bar`'s `-minimized` modifier hides this member's `.label` — see `side-nav-bar`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Kei te huna te kaitukatuka `-minimized` o te matua `side-nav-bar` i te `.label` o tēnei mema — tirohia ngā tuhinga a `side-nav-bar` mō taua kaitukatuka."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active nav item."
msgstr "Te tūemi whakatere e mahi ana."

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The item's text label; hidden when the rail is minimized."
msgstr "Tapanga kuputuhi o te tūemi; ka huna ina whakaitihia te pae taha."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — He ara whakatere poutū o ngā tūemi tohu kei runga i ngā tapanga, me tētahi aratau iti kei tohu-anake."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between nav items and its own `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. See the `side-nav-bar.item` member for the individual nav entries."
msgstr "Ka whakarite i tōna ake `gap` i waenga i ngā tūemi whakatere me tōna ake `padding`; mā te hono i tētahi `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` whakarerekētanga ā-āputa ka whakakapi i aua uara hanga-i-roto. Tirohia te mema `side-nav-bar.item` mō ia tomokanga whakatere."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label so it's announced as a named navigation landmark."
msgstr "Tāpirihia he tapanga aria-label ki te `<nav>` kia pānuitia ai hei tohu whakatere kua ingoa."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a glyph icon in each nav item."
msgstr "Whakaatu he tohu āhua (glyph) i roto i ia tūemi whakatere."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collapse to icons only (labels hidden). @affects side-nav-bar.item — Hides the item's label."
msgstr "Potohia ki ngā tohu anake (ka huna ngā tapanga). @affects side-nav-bar.item — E huna ana te tapanga o te tūemi."

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The nav item's text label."
msgstr "Te tapanga kuputuhi o te tūemi whakatere."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: simple-select"
msgstr ""

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-simple-select` — A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-simple-select` — He `<select>` taketake kua whakapaipaihia me te caret, e ōrite ana ki ngā āhuatanga me ngā rahi o te wāhanga whakauru kuputuhi."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps a plain native `<select>` with no custom dropdown/menu markup, so browser-native option rendering and keyboard behavior apply as-is; it shares its field chrome with `text-input`."
msgstr "E kapi ana i tētahi `<select>` taketake māmā kāore he tohu dropdown/menu ritenga, nō reira ka pā tonu te whakaaturanga kōwhiringa ā-tirotiro me te whanonga papapātuhi; ka tiritiria tōna āhua ā-papa ki `text-input`."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text, in a muted color that shifts on hover."
msgstr "Te kuputuhi tūāhua, i roto i te tae pākū (muted) e hurihia ana ina ka pāhia (hover)."

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same field chrome, states, and sizes.\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — The dropdown surface a richer select reuses."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Ka tiritahi i te āhua ā-papa, ngā āhuatanga, me ngā rahi.\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Ko te mata o te dropdown e whakamahia ana anō e tētahi select whai rawa."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spacing"
msgstr ""

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--p-md` — Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "`.--p-md` — Ngā taputapu tahua me te tāpai — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` me `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` i runga i te taumata wāhi (ngā taha `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y`, kāore rānei, tuhituhi poto, tuhituhi roa rānei — hei tauira `--mb-sm` me `--margin-bottom-small` he ture kotahi; ka taea hoki e te tahua te tango i `auto`). Ka taea te whakamahi mā te tuku anake, mā te hono rānei ki tētahi wāhanga (hei tauira `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies medium padding on all sides."
msgstr "Ka whakauru i te tāpai waenganui ki ngā taha katoa."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "Ngā taputapu tahua mō ngā tuhituhi poto, tuhituhi-roa tawhito, me ngā tuhituhi-roa katoa."

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Padding utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "Ngā taputapu tāpai mō ngā tuhituhi poto, tuhituhi-roa tawhito, me ngā tuhituhi-roa katoa."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spinner"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-spinner` — An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "`.instui-spinner` — He mowhiti uta e neke ana; homai ki a ia te role=\"status\" me te aria-label."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-color-inverse` only repaints the animated top border segment, not the whole track, so it still reads correctly on a dark card without needing a separate track color."
msgstr "`-color-inverse` e whakakakahu ana anake i te wahanga ārahi kei runga e pākia ana, ehara i te ara katoa, nō reira ka pānuitia tonu i runga i te kāri pouri me kore e hiahiatia he tae ara motuhake."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the spinner role=\"status\" and an aria-label so screen readers announce it as a live loading status."
msgstr "Homai te role=\"status\" me te aria-label ki te spinner kia pānuitia e ngā pūrere pānui mata hei tūnga uta ora."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Inverse color -nocard"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On a dark surface."
msgstr "I runga i te mata pouri."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small. Long-form alias of `-size-xs`."
msgstr "Taumata-iti rawa. He ingoa roa rite mō `-size-xs`."

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small."
msgstr "Taumata-iti."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: stacking"
msgstr ""

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--stack-topmost` — z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "`.--stack-topmost` — taputapu hohonu z-index — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — ka taea te whakamahi mā te kore here, mā te here rānei ki runga i tētahi waahanga, kia whakatakoto ngā paparanga i runga i te rārangi kei te mārama, kaua e whakawhirinaki ki ngā tau kua whiriwhiria ā-ringa."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Above the default flow."
msgstr "Runga ake i te rerenga taunoa."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Below the default flow."
msgstr "Raro ake i te rerenga taunoa."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The lowest stacking depth."
msgstr "Te hohonu whakatakoto iti rawa."

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The highest stacking depth (overlays, menus)."
msgstr "Te hohonu whakatakoto teitei rawa (ngā uhi, ngā tahua)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.body"
msgstr "# CSS: table.body"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tbody` — The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "`tbody` — Ko te rōpū rārangi raraunga o te ripanga (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier restyles this member — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Ko te kaihuringa `-layout-stacked` o te matua `table` e whakahou i te āhua o tēnei mema — tirohia ngā tuhinga ake o `table` mō taua kaihuringa."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.cell"
msgstr "# CSS: table.cell"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`td` — A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "`td` — He pūtau raraunga (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier stacks this member as a block and labels it via `::before` — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Ko te kaiwhakarerekē `-layout-stacked` o te mātua `table` e whakarārangi ana i tēnei mema hei poraka, ā, ka tapaina mā te `::before` — tirohia ngā tuhinga a `table` mō taua kaiwhakarerekē."

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.col-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.col-header"

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th` — A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "`th` — He pūtau pūwerenga taitara o te pou (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); ko te kāhua taunoa `th`, ā, kua whakakapihia e `table.row-header` mō `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.head"
msgstr "# CSS: table.head"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`thead` — The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "`thead` — Ko te rōpū o ngā rārangi ūpoko o te ripanga (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier visually hides this member (its column titles surface per-cell instead) — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Ko te whakarerekē `-layout-stacked` o te matua `table` e huna ana i tēnei mema i te āhua (ko ōna taitara pou ka puta i ia pūtau) — titiro ki te tuhinga ake o `table` mō taua whakarerekē."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table"
msgstr ""

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-table` — A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-table` — He ripanga raraunga kua whakapaipai mō `th` me `td` me tētahi taitara kōwhiringa, ā, he āhua hover, whakarite, me ngā tatauranga kāri tūpapa."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For `-layout-stacked`, pure CSS can't pull each column header's text into its cell, so give every cell a `data-label` and the stacked card shows it via `::before`. See the `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, and `table.row-header` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Mō `-layout-stacked`, kāore e taea e te CSS māmā te kukume i te kuputu o ia upoko tīwae ki roto i tōna pūtau, nō reira hoatu he `data-label` ki ia pūtau, ā, ka whakaatu te kāri tūpapa i taua mea mā te `::before`. Tirohia ngā mema `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, me `table.row-header` mō ngā wāhanga takitahi."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the table with a `<caption>`, mark column headers `<th scope=\"col\">` and row headers `<th scope=\"row\">`, and in `-layout-stacked` give every cell a `data-label` since the header row is visually hidden."
msgstr "Tūhuratia te ripanga ki tētahi `<caption>`, tohuia ngā upoko tīwae kia `<th scope=\"col\">` me ngā upoko rārangi kia `<th scope=\"row\">`, ā, i roto i te `-layout-stacked` hoatu he `data-label` ki ia pūtau i te mea kua huna ā-āhua te rārangi upoko."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlight rows on hover. @affects table.row — Reserves and colours the row's hover border."
msgstr "Whakaahuatia ngā rārangi i te pāhi (hover). @affects table.row — E rēhita ana, e tae ana hoki te taha ārai pāhi o te rārangi."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed table layout (equal-width columns)."
msgstr "Te tukunga ripanga whakatika (ngā tīwae whanui ōrite)."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stack each row as a card, via a per-cell `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stacks each part as a block and hides/labels the header accordingly."
msgstr "Tūpapaia ia rārangi hei kāri, mā te `data-label` mō ia pūtau. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — E tūpapa ana ia wāhanga hei tūblock, ā, ka huna/ka tapaina hoki te upoko i runga i te āhua."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional table caption."
msgstr "He taitara ripanga kōwhiringa."

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row-header"

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — He pūtau upoko-rārangi (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); kua hoahoatia mai i ngā tohu upoko-rārangi, ehara i ngā tohu upoko-tīwae."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tr` — A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "`tr` — He rarangi ripanga (InstUI `Table.Row`)."

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-hover` and `-layout-stacked` modifiers restyle this member — see `table`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Ko ngā whakatikatika `-hover` me `-layout-stacked` o te mātua `table` e hurihia te āhua o tēnei mema — tirohia te tuhinga a `table` mō ēnā whakatikatika."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tabs` — A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "`.instui-tabs` — He huinga papa ripa: he rārangi ripa, he ripa ka taea te tīpako, me ō rātou papa."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `tabs.tab` and `tabs.panel` members for the individual tab buttons and their content panels."
msgstr "Tirohia ngā mema `tabs.tab` me `tabs.panel` mō ngā pātene ripa takitahi me ō rātou papa ihirangi."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire the tab list with role=\"tablist\", each tab with role=\"tab\" and aria-selected, and each panel with role=\"tabpanel\"."
msgstr "Tautuhia te rārangi ripa kia role=\"tablist\", ia ripa kia role=\"tab\" me aria-selected, ā, ia papa kia role=\"tabpanel\"."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the tab list on one line and let it scroll horizontally instead of wrapping, hiding the scrollbar."
msgstr "Puritia te rārangi ripa kia kotahi te rārangi, ā, kia taea te takahuri ā-taha (scroll horizontally) kaua e whakarōpū; hunaia te pae tārahu."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rounded \"folder\" tabs with a selected tab that visually connects into the panel below. @affects tabs.tab — Restyles the tab buttons into the rounded \"folder\" look."
msgstr "Rounded \"folder\" tabs with a selected tab that visually connects into the panel below. @affects tabs.tab — Ka whakahou i te āhua o ngā pātene ripa kia rite ki te āhua \"kōpaki\" porowhita."

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The row of tabs."
msgstr "Te rārangi ripa."

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.panel"
msgstr "# CSS: tabs.panel"

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.panel` — The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "`.panel` — He panui ihirangi mō tētahi ripa (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.tab"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — He pātene ripa kotahi (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, i whirihorahia mā te rārangi ripa o te mātua `Tabs`); ko `-selected` te tohu i te mea e mahi ana."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Ko te kaiwhakaohotanga `-variant-secondary` o te mātua `tabs` e huri ana i te āhua o tēnei mema kia ripa \"kōpaki\" porowhita — tirohia ngā tuhinga a `tabs` mō taua kaiwhakaohotanga."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Non-interactive; same styling as `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."
msgstr "Kāore e taea te whakapā; he āhua tōrite ki `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active tab; same styling as `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Te ripa e mahi ana; he āhua tōrite ki `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tag"
msgstr ""

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tag` — An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "`.instui-tag` — He rīpene iti i roto i te rārangi mō te kupu matua, te tātari rānei."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "Ka tautuhi i tōna ake `padding` ā-tātari (ka rahihia e `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`); ko te here i tētahi kaitahuri wāhi `-p-*`/`-padding-*` ka whakawāteahia taua uara kua hanga."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Reads inline with text and gets a trailing dismiss glyph."
msgstr "Ka pānui tahi me te kuputuhi i te rārangi, ā, ka whai tohu whakamutu i muri."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read-only (non-dismissable) tag."
msgstr "Tapanga pānuitia-anake (kāore e taea te whakamutu)."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "He tapanga nui. He ingoa roa taurite mō `-size-lg`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large tag."
msgstr "He tapanga nui."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag."
msgstr "He tapanga iti."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small tag. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "He tapanga iti. He ingoa roa taurite mō `-size-sm`."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the trailing dismiss glyph on a dismissible inline tag."
msgstr "Ka whakaatu i te tohu whakamutu kei muri mō te tapanga rārangi ka taea te whakamutu."

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — The read-only label-chip counterpart."
msgstr "- [pill](/api/css/pill.md) — Te taurite tapanga-tīhi pānui-anake."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: testimonial"
msgstr ""

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-testimonial\"]` — Whakaaturanga kīanga, taunaki rānei me te whakapuaki ingoa me ētahi whakaahua kōwhiringa."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "✅ Whakamahia te Taunaki ina:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying customer or user testimonials and quotes\n- You want to highlight a statement with visual emphasis\n- Attribution and context (name, title, image) are important\n🚫 Don't use Testimonial when:"
msgstr "- He whakaaturanga i ngā taunakitanga me ngā kīanga a te kiritaki, te kaiwhakamahi rānei\n- Kei te hiahia koe ki te whakamārama i tētahi kōrero mā te whakakite ā-āhua\n- He mea nui te ingoa tuku me te horopaki (ingoa, taitara, whakaahua)\n🚫 Kaua e whakamahi i te Taunaki ina:"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying inline quotes in body text — use a blockquote element instead\n- The statement is the main focus — use Hero or Card instead"
msgstr "- Te whakaatu kīanga ā-roto i te kuputohu — whakamahia he āhuatanga blockquote kē\n- Mēnā ko te kōrero te tino kaupapa — whakamahia Hero, Card rānei"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use `<blockquote>` semantically for the quote\n- Ensure attribution is clear and associated with the quote\n- If using images, provide alt text"
msgstr "- Whakamahia `<blockquote>` i runga i te tikanga mō te kīanga\n- Me mārama te ingoa tuku, me hono ki te kīanga\n- Mēnā ka whakamahi i ngā whakaahua, whakarato tuhinga āwhina (alt)"

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Attribution author name."
msgstr "Ingoa kaituhi tuku."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author profile image."
msgstr "Whakaahua kōtaha kaituhi (kōwhiringa)."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for quote and attribution."
msgstr "Kōpaki mō te kīanga me te ingoa tuku."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The quoted text."
msgstr "Te tuhinga i kīia."

#: css/testimonial.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional author title or affiliation."
msgstr "Taitara kaituhi, rānei tōna hononga (kōwhiringa)."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-area"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-area` — A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "`.instui-text-area` — He `<textarea>` taketake kua whakakākahu, ka taea te whakarahi, me ngā āhua me ngā rahi ōrite ki te tomokanga kuputuhi."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and focus states with `text-input` and `simple-select`; only `resize: vertical` and the taller minimum height are unique to it."
msgstr "Ka tohaina tōna taha, papamuri, me ngā āhua arotahi ki `text-input` me `simple-select`; ko `resize: vertical` me te teitei iti rawa ake anake ngā mea motuhake ki a ia."

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-area.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-area/text-area.css)"

#: css/text-area.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — The single-line counterpart with the same states and sizes."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Te hoa kotahi-rārangi me ngā āhuatanga me ngā rahi ōrite."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text-input` — A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-text-input` — He `<input>` taketake kua whakarite ā-tāhua — me ngā `date`, `time`, me `datetime-local`, ā, ko te kaitīpiri e whakaratoa ana e te kaitirotiro — me ngā tūnga whakamana me ngā rahi."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shares its border, background, and state chrome with `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input`, and `input-group`; for `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` types the browser supplies its own picker UI, which this stylesheet doesn't style."
msgstr "Ka toha tāna tahora, papamuri, me te chrome tūnga ki `text-area`, `simple-select`, `number-input`, me `input-group`; mō ngā momo `date`/`time`/`datetime-local` ka whakarato te kaitirotiro i tōna ake atanga kaitīpiri, ā, kāore tēnei kāhua-ā-tukatuka e āta-whakarite i taua atanga."

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text-input/text-input.css)"

#: css/text-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — The multi-line counterpart with the same states and sizes.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The numeric-entry input sharing this chrome.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — The native select sharing this field chrome.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Wraps this input with leading and trailing slots."
msgstr "- [text-area](/api/css/text-area.md) — Te āpiha rārangi-maha, he ōrite ngā tūnga me ngā rahi.\n- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — Te urunga tau e tiritiri ana i tēnei chrome.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — Te kōwhiringa taketake e tiritiri ana i tēnei chrome ā-papa.\n- [input-group](/api/css/input-group.md) — Ka whakamau i tēnei urunga ki roto i tētahi rōpū me ngā mokowā ā-mua me ngā mokowā ā-muri."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: text"
msgstr ""

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "`.instui-text` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — He momo ā-tuhi tinana (body-text) me ngā whakarerekētanga rahi, taumaha, tae, me te āhua."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets and the `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` modifiers all compose on the same element; unlike `heading`, it renders no implicit semantic level."
msgstr "Ko ngā tautuhinga `-variant-*` me ngā whakarerekētanga `-color-*`/`-size-*`/`-weight-*` ka whakakotahi katoa i runga i te tūemi kotahi; kāore i pēnei i a `heading`, kāore e whakatakoto i tētahi taumata tikanga ā-waho."

#: css/text.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [text.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/text/text.css)"

