#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: truncate"
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "`.--truncate` — Whakatewhatewhatanga ellipsis me te whakamau rārangi ka whakahaerehia e `--lines` — ka taea te whakamahi ā-tūturu, ā-rārangi rānei ki runga i tētahi wāhanga (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base class uses `display: -webkit-box` and reads the `--lines` custom property to clamp text to a fixed number of lines before it ends in an ellipsis."
msgstr "Kei te whakamahi te karaehe turanga i te `display: -webkit-box` ā, ka pānui i te taonga ritenga `--lines` kia here i te kuputu ki tētahi nama rārangi kua whakaritea i mua i te whakaoti ki te ellipsis."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Requirement"
msgstr "Āhei JS"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component ships no CSS of its own — its markup and behavior come entirely from `@pantoken/interactions`. Its `--max-lines-auto` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "Kāore tēnei wahanga e tuku CSS āna ake — mai i te `@pantoken/interactions` katoa tona tohu me tana whanonga. Ko tana whakarerekētanga `--max-lines-auto` ka taraiwahia e taua whanonga. Tirohia te [rārangi whakarerekētanga i raro](#modifiers)."

#: css/truncate.md
