#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: two-column"
msgstr ""

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Hoahoa rua-kolomū me ngā wāhanga ihirangi mauī me matau."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "✅ Whakamahia Two-Column ina:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You have two content areas of roughly equal importance\n- Comparing or contrasting two sets of content side-by-side\n- Building a responsive layout that stacks on mobile\n🚫 Don't use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "- He rua ngā wāhanga ihirangi e tata ana te hiranga\n- Hei whakataurite, hei whakawehe rānei i ngā kohinga ihirangi e rua taha-ki-taha\n- Te hanga hoahoa urupare e whakarārangi ana i runga i ngā pūrere pūkoro\n🚫 Kaua e whakamahi i te Two-Column ina:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- One column dominates the page — use asymmetric layout instead\n- Content doesn't benefit from side-by-side presentation"
msgstr "- Ka rangatira tētahi kolomū i te whārangi — whakamahia he hoahoa kore-ōrite anō\n- Kāore e whai painga te ihirangi i te whakaaturanga taha-ki-taha"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure both columns are perceivable and usable on narrow viewports\n- Use semantic landmarks (e.g., `<section>`) to wrap column content\n- Maintain sufficient space and contrast between columns"
msgstr "- Kia kitea, kia whakamahia ngā kolomū e rua i runga i ngā mata tirohanga whīiti\n- Whakamahia ngā tohu ā-ōhanga (hei tauira, `<section>`) ki te whakakapi i ngā ihirangi kolomū\n- Tiakina he wāhi me te tauwhitiwhiti tae e tika ana i waenga i ngā kolomū"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional visual divider between columns."
msgstr "Wāhanga wehenga ā-ataahua kōwhiringa i waenga i ngā kolomū."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left column content area."
msgstr "Wāhanga ihirangi kolomū mauī."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Right column content area."
msgstr "Wāhanga ihirangi kolomū matau."

