#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.-with-visual-debug` — A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "`.-with-visual-debug` — He anga hei whakatika i te whakaritenga: pūmua `.-with-visual-debug` ki runga i tētahi waahanga kia whakaata i te pouaka me ōna tamariki tōtika, kia mārama tonu te hanganga o te whakaritenga."

