msgstr "Te tae o te anga (taunoa: he magenta kanapa); whakarerekēhia te tae kia huri ai ia anga whakatika."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: wrapper"
msgstr ""

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — Rārangi app-shell: nav taha, ipu me te upoko, me tētahi anga kōwhiringa."

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "✅ Whakamahia te Wrapper ina:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "- E waihanga ana i tētahi whārangi hua Canvas katoa e hiahiatia ana he anga āhua tuturu\n- Ka whakamahi te whārangi i te GlobalNav hei tūāpapa whakatere matua\n- Ka hiahia te whārangi ki ngā panui taha: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, rānei he UtilityPanel\n- E hiahia ana koe ki te pātūriki ipu tūroa me te whānui mō te ihirangi i runga i te whārangi katoa\n🚫 Kaua e whakamahia te Wrapper ina:"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
msgstr "- E waihanga ana i tētahi Mōtini (Modal), Tray, rānei Drawer — he ipu ā rātou ake ngā tārua anga\n- E pūwrapa ana i tētahi wāhanga o te whārangi — ko te Wrapper te nuinga o te whārangi katoa, ehara i te rohe anake"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
msgstr "- Mahia te waahi ihirangi matua kia tēnei hei tohu &lt;main&gt; me tētahi hononga skip-nav kia taea e ngā kaiwhakamahi papapāho te whakakāhore i te GlobalNav\n- Whakaratohia te ContentTabList ki te role=\"navigation\" me tētahi aria-label motuhake pēnei i te \"Whakatere whārangi\" — wehe atu i te tohu o te GlobalNav\n- Whakaratohia te TrailingContentArea ki te role=\"complementary\" me tētahi aria-label whakamārama e whakaata ana i tōna ihirangi, pēnei i te \"Ngā taipitopito ākonga\"\n- Whakaratohia ki ia UtilityPanel tētahi aria-label motuhake: \"Kaiawhina AI\", \"Ngā whakamōhiotanga\", rānei \"Tātari\"\n- Ina whakatuwhera tētahi UtilityPanel, nekehia te arotahi ki roto i te panui; ina kati, whakahokia te arotahi ki te anga i whakatuwhera i taua panui"

