msgstr "Ka waihanga ia i tētahi kohinga taurite kotahi me ngā aratau `light`/`dark`: ka huri ngā tohu tae ki ngā `COLOR`\ntaurite (RGBA 0–1), ka huri ngā inenga/taurangi tau ki ngā `FLOAT`, ā, ko ngā mea kē katoa ki ngā `STRING`. Ka whakakorea ngā ikonā\n(he wāhanga Figma ēnei, ehara i ngā taurite). Tukuna [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) ki tētahi pūtāuru Figma\n(plugin) (te Variables plugin API) rānei ki te Variables REST API — kei te README ngā hononga mō te plugin."

