#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the aggregated component stylesheet: every component's rules in the `COMPONENTS` concat order.\nThe size-alias and alias twins are appended PER COMPONENT (within its own chunk) so each alias\ndocuments on its own page — the aliases are discovered from each record's `@alias {@link -x}` or\n`@deprecated {@link -x}` metadata (see `withAliases`), not a central hand-kept list. The\n`--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale the components reference is defined in the token sheet\n(`@pantoken/css`), so it's no longer inlined here."
msgstr "Waihangahia te kāri āhuatanga kōranu mō ngā wāhanga: ngā ture katoa o ia wāhanga i te raupapa whakauru `COMPONENTS`.\nKa tāpirihia ngā ingoa taurite rahi me ngā ingoa taurite ia WĀHANGA (kei roto i tōna ake wāhanga) kia tuhia ia ingoa taurite ki tōna ake whārangi — ka kitea ngā ingoa taurite mai i te `@alias {@link -x}` rānei te `@deprecated {@link -x}` metadata o ia rekoata (tēnā tirohia `withAliases`), ehara i te rārangi pokapū e tiakina ā-ringa. Ko te tauira ā-ātārangi `--instui-elevation-*` e tohu ana i ngā rahi mō ngā waahanga kua tautuhia i te pepa tohu (`@pantoken/css`), nō reira kāore e whakauru ā-tuhi ki konei."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: elevationCss()"
msgstr "# Mahi: elevationCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the elevation token block: `<selector> { --instui-elevation-*: … }`. Shipped inside\n`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), and reusable by other\nlayered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."
msgstr "Build the elevation token block: `&lt;selector&gt; { --instui-elevation-*: … }`. Shipped inside\n`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), and reusable by other\nlayered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`selector` — the rule selector (default `:root`)."
msgstr "`selector` — te kōwhiri ture (taunoa `:root`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### selector?"
msgstr "#### selector?"

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: elevationDeclarations()"
msgstr "# Mahi: elevationDeclarations()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `--instui-elevation-*` name/value pairs (each a multi-layer `box-shadow`). Values reference the\nthemed drop-shadow colour tokens, so they adapt per theme wherever a token sheet is loaded."
msgstr "Ko ngā tāpare ingoa/wāriu `--instui-elevation-*` (ia tētahi he `box-shadow` maha-ā-tūre). Ka tohu ngā wāriu ki ngā tohu tae mō te atarangi takahuri (drop-shadow) ā-kaupapa, nō reira ka urutau ki ia kaupapa i te wā e utua ana he ripanga tohu."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One `[customProperty, value]` pair per level and alias."
msgstr "Kotahi tāpare `[customProperty, value]` mō ia taumata me ia ingoa kē."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: focusOutlineCss()"
msgstr "# Mahi: focusOutlineCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the focus-outline block: the `--instui-focus-outline-*` token defs plus the ring rules.\nBaked into `base.css` (so focusables get the ring out of the box), and reusable by other layered\noutputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector`/`tokenSelector` options."
msgstr "Hangaia te poraka focus-outline: ngā tautuhinga tohu `--instui-focus-outline-*` me ngā ture ring.\nKua whakaurua ki `base.css` (nā reira ka whiwhi ngā mea e taea ana te aro ki a rātou te ring i te tīmatanga), ā, ka taea te whakamahia anō e ētahi atu putanga paparua\n(hei tauira te kaiwhakahua Pendo) mā ngā kōwhiringa `selector`/`tokenSelector`."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`selector` — the focusable selector; `tokenSelector` — where the token defs land\n  (default `:where(:root)`)."
msgstr "`selector` — te kaitātari e taea ana te aro ki a ia; `tokenSelector` — ko te wāhi ka taurite ai ngā tautuhinga tohu\n  (taunoa `:where(:root)`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### tokenSelector?"
msgstr "#### tokenSelector?"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: focusOutlineDeclarations()"
msgstr "# Mahi: focusOutlineDeclarations()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `--instui-focus-outline-*` name/value pairs the ring rules read. Colour/width/offset reference\nthe themed shared focus tokens; the transition, line style, and inset are constants."
msgstr "Ko ngā takirua ingoa/wāriu `--instui-focus-outline-*` e pānuitia ana e ngā ture mō te porowhita. Ko te tae/te whānui/te whakaroa e tohu ana ki ngā tohu aro ā-kaupapa kua tohatohahia;\nko te whakawhitinga, te āhua raina, me te whakaurunga he uara pūmau."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One `[customProperty, value]` pair per focus-ring variable."
msgstr "Kotahi takirua `[customProperty, value]` mō ia rerekētanga porowhita aro."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: focusOutlineRules()"
msgstr "# Mahi: focusOutlineRules()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The focus-ring rules for a given focusable selector: a transparent resting ring that transitions in\non `:focus-visible`, plus the `-focus-color-*` / `-focus-position-inset` / `-focus-within` /\n`-without-focus-animation` modifiers. All `:where()`-wrapped, so zero-specificity."
msgstr "Ngā ture focus-ring mō tētahi tohu ka taea te arotahi (focusable): he porohita whakatā mōrearea (transparent resting ring) e tārewa ana\ni roto i runga i `:focus-visible`, me ngā kaitārewa `-focus-color-*` / `-focus-position-inset` / `-focus-within` /\n`-without-focus-animation`. Katoa kua takai ki `:where()`, nō reira kāore he motuhēhē (zero-specificity)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### selector?"
msgstr "### selector?"

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The focusable selector the base ring applies to (default [FOCUSABLE\\_SELECTOR](../variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md))."
msgstr "Te tohu ka taea te arotahi (focusable selector) e hāngai ana te porohita turanga ki a ia (taunoa [FOCUSABLE\\_SELECTOR](../variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md))."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS rules string."
msgstr "Te rārangi ture CSS."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: iconGlyphsCss()"
msgstr "# Mahi: iconGlyphsCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the icon-glyph stylesheet: one `.<prefix>-icon-<name>` class per icon that points\n`--pantoken-glyph` at the matching `--instui-icon-<name>` token. Kept out of the component bundle\n(it's large); ships as its own `icons.css`. Pass the icon names (e.g. from `@pantoken/icons`)."
msgstr "Build the icon-glyph stylesheet: one `.&lt;prefix&gt;-icon-&lt;name&gt;` class per icon that points\n`--pantoken-glyph` at the matching `--instui-icon-&lt;name&gt;` token. Kept out of the component bundle\n(it's large); ships as its own `icons.css`. Pass the icon names (e.g. from `@pantoken/icons`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### names"
msgstr "### names"

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "readonly `string`[]"
msgstr "readonly `string`[]"

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names without the `--instui-icon-` prefix (e.g. `[\"megaphone\", \"check\"]`)."
msgstr "Ngā ingoa tohu (icon) me te kore o te āpitenga `--instui-icon-` i mua (hei tauira `[\"megaphone\", \"check\"]`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[IconGlyphsOptions](../interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md) (adds `deprecatedAliases` to [ComponentOptions](../interfaces/ComponentOptions.md))."
msgstr "[IconGlyphsOptions](../interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md) (taapiri i te `deprecatedAliases` ki [ComponentOptions](../interfaces/ComponentOptions.md))."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This is the glyph-token half of the icon system (the `.-icon-<name>` modifiers, shipped as\n`icons.css`); the `icon` utility is the painter half (the shared `::before`). They share the `icon`\ndemo."
msgstr "This is the glyph-token half of the icon system (the `.-icon-&lt;name&gt;` modifiers, shipped as\n`icons.css`); the `icon` utility is the painter half (the shared `::before`). They share the `icon`\ndemo."

#: formats/components/src/functions/proseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: proseCss()"
msgstr "# Mahi: proseCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/proseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the InstUI-look prose stylesheet, scoped to `options.scope` (default `:where(body)`, so it\napplies automatically without a wrapper class — like `base.css`)."
msgstr "Hangaia te raupapa kāhua kōrero āhua-InstUI, ā, āpitihia ki `options.scope` (taunoa `:where(body)`, nō reira ka\ntono aunoa me te kore e whai i tētahi kāwai kapi — pērā i `base.css`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/selectCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: selectCss()"
msgstr "# Mahi: selectCss()"

#: formats/components/src/functions/selectCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **experimental** customizable-select enhancement for `.<prefix>-simple-select`. Everything is\ngated behind `@supports (appearance: base-select)` (the CSS Customizable Select model — Chrome 135+,\nNOT yet Baseline), so it's pure progressive enhancement: browsers without support keep the plain\n`simpleSelectCss` control; supporting browsers get a styled `::picker(select)` panel and styled\n`option`s (hover/selected) from the `--instui-component-options-item-*` tokens. Shipped as its own\nopt-in `select.css` (like `fonts.css`) rather than folded into `components.css`, precisely because the\nfeature is experimental — you opt in deliberately."
msgstr "The **experimental** customizable-select enhancement for `.&lt;prefix&gt;-simple-select`. Everything is\ngated behind `@supports (appearance: base-select)` (the CSS Customizable Select model — Chrome 135+,\nNOT yet Baseline), so it's pure progressive enhancement: browsers without support keep the plain\n`simpleSelectCss` control; supporting browsers get a styled `::picker(select)` panel and styled\n`option`s (hover/selected) from the `--instui-component-options-item-*` tokens. Shipped as its own\nopt-in `select.css` (like `fonts.css`) rather than folded into `components.css`, precisely because the\nfeature is experimental — you opt in deliberately."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# components"
msgstr "# components"

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/components` — an InstUI-look CSS component library, built from the `--instui-*` tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/components` — he r library CSS āhua InstUI, i hangaia mai i ngā tohu `--instui-*`."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The shipped stylesheets:"
msgstr "Ngā āhuatanga kāhua kua tukuna:"

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- **Base** ([baseCss](functions/baseCss.md)) — opt-in global document defaults from the tokens (box-sizing, body\n  reset, page surface, base text colour/font, `color-scheme`). It also carries the focus-outline\n  ring, so every focusable gets an accessible `:focus-visible` outline out of the box. Load it when\n  pantoken owns the page.\n- **Prose** ([proseCss](functions/proseCss.md)) — styles rendered markdown/prose HTML (tables, headings, links,\n  lists, code) scoped to a content root, so a docs page or content region looks like InstUI\n  without swapping the DOM for components. This is what the site renderers ship as their\n  `components.css`.\n- **Components** ([buttonCss](variables/buttonCss.md), [alertCss](variables/alertCss.md), [badgeCss](variables/badgeCss.md), aggregated by\n  [componentsCss](functions/componentsCss.md)) — class-based component styles you apply to your own markup\n  (`<button class=\"instui-button\">`), for the InstUI look outside a component framework. The\n  `--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale ([elevationCss](functions/elevationCss.md)) leads this sheet, since enough\n  components float that shadows are an intrinsic design attribute rather than an add-on.\n- **Utilities** ([viewCss](variables/viewCss.md), [spacingUtilitiesCss](variables/spacingUtilitiesCss.md), [gapCss](variables/gapCss.md), [layoutUtilitiesCss](variables/layoutUtilitiesCss.md), plus a\n  curated semantic-colour/token set) — an opt-in layer of cross-cutting classes. The generic\n  token→class emitters (`colorUtilitiesCss`, `tokenUtilitiesCss`) live in `@pantoken/utils`; this\n  package feeds them the curated *semantic* names, while `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` feeds the raw\n  palette.\n- **Fonts** (opt-in `fonts.css`) — the `@font-face` rules for the Instructure brand fonts. Base\n  *applies* the font; `fonts.css` *loads* the woff2s, so text degrades gracefully without it."
msgstr "- **Base** ([baseCss](functions/baseCss.md)) — ngā tautuhinga ao tuatahi whiriwhiri (opt-in) i runga i ngā tohu (box-sizing, whakahoki tinana\n  body, mata whārangi, tae kuputuhi/momo momotuhi tūnga, `color-scheme`). Ka kawe hoki i te rīngi ārahi-kohu (focus-outline), nō reira ia tūnga-a-aro ka whiwhi `:focus-visible` ātaahua e taea ana te uru mai i te tīmatanga. Tāuria mēnā ko pantoken te kaitiaki o te whārangi.\n- **Prose** ([proseCss](functions/proseCss.md)) — ngā kāhua mō HTML markdown/prose (ngā ripanga, taitara, hononga,\n  rārangi, waehere) i whakawhānuitia ki tētahi pakiaka ihirangi, kia rite te whārangi tuhinga, te wāhi ihirangi rānei ki te āhua InstUI\n  me te kore e hurihia te DOM hei hanganga. Koinei te mea e tukuna ana e ngā kaiwhakaata pae hei\n  `components.css`.\n- **Components** ([buttonCss](variables/buttonCss.md), [alertCss](variables/alertCss.md), [badgeCss](variables/badgeCss.md), kua kohia e\n  [componentsCss](functions/componentsCss.md)) — ngā kāhua wāhanga ā-kīwaha (class-based) hei whakamahi i runga i ōu ake tohu\n  (`<button class=\"instui-button\">`), mō te āhua InstUI i waho o tētahi anga waahanga. Ko te\n  āhua whēkau (shadow) rahi `--instui-elevation-*` ([elevationCss](functions/elevationCss.md)) e arahina ana tēnei kōwhai, nā te mea he nui ngā\n  wahanga e rere ana, ā, he āhuatanga hoahoa tāpiri tonu ngā atarangi, ehara i te taapiri noa.\n- **Utilities** ([viewCss](variables/viewCss.md), [spacingUtilitiesCss](variables/spacingUtilitiesCss.md), [gapCss](variables/gapCss.md), [layoutUtilitiesCss](variables/layoutUtilitiesCss.md), me te\n  huinga tohu/tae whakarite) — he paparanga kōwhiri (opt-in) o ngā kāwai whakawhiti-whakararo. Ko ngā\n  kaiwhakakī token→class mōhiohio (`colorUtilitiesCss`, `tokenUtilitiesCss`) e noho ana i `@pantoken/utils`; ka whāngai tēnei\n  pākete i ngā ingoa *semantic* kua tīpakohia, ā, ko `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` te kaiwhāngai i te karaehe mata.\n- **Fonts** (opt-in `fonts.css`) — ngā ture `@font-face` mō ngā momotuhi tohu Instructure. Ko te Base\n  *e whakamahi ana* i te momotuhi; ko `fonts.css` *e uta* i ngā woff2, nō reira ka heke ātaahua te kuputuhi mēnā kāore."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Everything is pure CSS derived from the token IR, so it tracks InstUI through the tokens with no\ndependency on the InstUI React packages. For the real, interactive components, use\n`@pantoken/react-markdown` (content) or `@instructure/ui-*` (apps)."
msgstr "He CSS tītī katoa ngā mea, i ahu mai i te token IR, nō reira e whai haere ana ki te InstUI mā ngā tohu me te kore rānei o te whakawhirinaki ki ngā pākete React InstUI. Mō ngā waahanga tūhono tūturu, whakamahia\n`@pantoken/react-markdown` (i ngā ihirangi) rānei `@instructure/ui-*` (i ngā taupānga)."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This module is a barrel: each documented record lives in its own file under\n`components/`/`utilities/`/`rules/`/`declarations/`, authored with the `lib/` compose API. The\nregistries (`COMPONENTS`/`UTILITIES`/`RULES`/`DECLARATIONS`) drive aggregation + the parity test."
msgstr "He pou tēnei mō ngā kōwae: ia rekoata kua tuhia e noho ana i tōna ake kōnae i raro i\n`components/`/`utilities/`/`rules/`/`declarations/`, i tuhia mā te API whakakotahi `lib/`. Ko ngā\nrēhita (`COMPONENTS`/`UTILITIES`/`RULES`/`DECLARATIONS`) e tarai ana i te kohinga + te whakamātautau parity."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: ComponentOptions"
msgstr "# Atanga: ComponentOptions"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options common to every builder."
msgstr "Ngā kōwhiringa e pā ana ki ia kaiwhakanao."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Extended by"
msgstr "## Extended by"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prefix?"
msgstr "### prefix?"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class prefix. A truthy string namespaces every class (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-button`); any\nfalsy value (`null`, `undefined`, `\"\"`, or omitting the option) drops the prefix entirely\n(`.button`), so you can author `class=\"heading -h1\"`. The stylesheets shipped by this package are\nbuilt with `\"instui\"`."
msgstr "Te tautau mua mō ngā karaehe. Ko tētahi aho pono ka whakarite ingoa wāhanga mō ia karaehe (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-button`); mō ngā uara hē kē (`null`, `undefined`, `\"\"`, rānei mā te waiho i te kōwhiringa) ka wetewetehia te tautau katoa (`.button`), nō reira ka taea e koe te tuhi `class=\"heading -h1\"`. Ko ngā kāri-kāhua (stylesheets) e tukuna ana e tēnei mōkihi kua hangaia me `\"instui\"`."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### theme?"
msgstr "### theme?"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target theme for emitted CSS. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"` when omitted."
msgstr "Te kaupapa whāinga mō te CSS e whakaputaina. He `\"rebrand\"` te taunoa mēnā kāore i whakatakotoria."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: IconGlyphsOptions"
msgstr "# Atanga: IconGlyphsOptions"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [iconGlyphsCss](../functions/iconGlyphsCss.md)."
msgstr "Kōwhiringa mō [iconGlyphsCss](../functions/iconGlyphsCss.md)."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Extends"
msgstr "## Whānui ake"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Inherited from"
msgstr "#### I whakawhiwhia mai i"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### deprecatedAliases?"
msgstr "### deprecatedAliases?"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Also emit the deprecated InstUI-prop glyph aliases (`-render-icon-<name>`, `-render-custom-icon-<name>`)\nas functional aliases of `-icon-<name>`. Off by default — turning it on roughly doubles the sheet, so\nenable it only when you need markup written against the old `renderIcon`/`renderCustomIcon` prop names\nto keep rendering. The shipped `icons.css` is built with this on."
msgstr "Also emit the deprecated InstUI-prop glyph aliases (`-render-icon-&lt;name&gt;`, `-render-custom-icon-&lt;name&gt;`)\nas functional aliases of `-icon-&lt;name&gt;`. Off by default — turning it on roughly doubles the sheet, so\nenable it only when you need markup written against the old `renderIcon`/`renderCustomIcon` prop names\nto keep rendering. The shipped `icons.css` is built with this on."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ProseOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: ProseOptions"
msgstr "# Atanga: ProseOptions"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ProseOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [proseCss](../functions/proseCss.md)."
msgstr "Ngā kōwhiringa mō [proseCss](../functions/proseCss.md)."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ProseOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### scope?"
msgstr "### scope?"

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ProseOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
