#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/css` — emit Instructure design tokens as `@property`-typed CSS."
msgstr "`@pantoken/css` — whakaputa i ngā token hoahoa Instructure hei CSS momo `@property`."

#: formats/css/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) turns any token IR into CSS; [css](variables/css.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` stylesheet and\n[leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) is a lean variant that drops the full `--instui-icon-*` set (the ~1,777 icon data-URIs\nthat dominate the sheet) for CDN/embed delivery — ~a sixth the size over the wire. Both carry the\nelevation + focus-outline foundation (composite custom properties whose pure builders live in\n`@pantoken/utils`), so a component sheet resolves its shadows and focus ring against the token sheet\nalone. A DOM side-effect entry lives at `@pantoken/css/inject`; static files at\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` and `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr "[toCss](functions/toCss.md) ka hurihia ngā IR token katoa hei CSS; [css](variables/css.md) ko te rau kāri `rebrand` kua reri, ā\nko [leanCss](variables/leanCss.md) he rerekētanga māmā ka whakakore i te katoa o te huinga `--instui-icon-*` (ko te ~1,777 o ngā icon data-URI\nngā mea nui e rangatira ana i te pepa) mō te tuku mā te CDN/whakanoho ā-ipurangi — tata ki te kotahi-whaanga o te rahi i runga i te ipurangi. E rua e kawe ana te\nturanga elevation + focus-outline (ngā kaupapa ritenga whakakotahi kei te noho kaihanga pūmau i\n`@pantoken/utils`), nō reira ka whakatau te pepa wāhanga i ōna ārai me te mekameka aro ki te pepa token\nanake. He tomo pānga taha-DOM kei `@pantoken/css/inject`; ko ngā kōnae tūmau kei\n`@pantoken/css/style.css` me `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

