msgstr "# Taipūtī: leanCss"

#: formats/css/src/variables/leanCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The lean `rebrand` stylesheet string — the full sheet minus the `--instui-icon-*` glyph tokens (the\n~1,777 icon data-URIs that make up most of [css](css.md)). Roughly a sixth the size over the wire; the\nrecommended foundation for CDN/embed delivery. Components reference only a handful of icons, shipped\nseparately as `@pantoken/components`'s `component-icons.css`; consumers who use `var(--instui-icon-*)`\nbroadly should load the full [css](css.md) (or the `icons.css` glyph sheet). See\n`@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."
msgstr "Te rārangi `rebrand` āhua-whakamāhara o te pepa kāhua — te pepa katoa, koretahi ngā tohu `--instui-icon-*` (ngā ~1,777 ngā raraunga-URI-patawai ā-ata e hanga ana i te nuinga o te [css](css.md)). He tata ki te rima o te rahi i runga i te ipurangi; ko te pūtake tūtohutia mō te tuku atu mā te CDN/whakauru. He tokoiti noa ngā tohu e whakamahia ana e ngā wahanga, ka tukuna wehe hei `@pantoken/components`'s `component-icons.css`; ko ngā kaihoko e whakamahi whānuitia ana i te `var(--instui-icon-*)` me uta te [css](css.md) katoa (kāore rānei te pepa tohu `icons.css`). Tirohia `@pantoken/css/style.lean.css`."

