msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/icon-font` — build an installable Instructure icon font (WOFF2 + TTF) with a matching\nstylesheet and codepoint map. Unlike the inline-SVG paths, a font installs on a device, so it\nworks in design apps and offline contexts where the web tooling isn't reachable."
msgstr "`@pantoken/icon-font` — hangaia he momotuhi tohu Instructure e taea te whakauru (WOFF2 + TTF) me tētahi\nstylesheet me te mapi waehere. Ōrite ki ngā ara inline-SVG, kāore e pēnei te āhua: ka whakauruhia te momotuhi ki runga i te pūrere, nō reira ka mahi i ngā taupānga hoahoa me ngā horopaki kore-ipurangi kāore e wātea ana ngā taputapu tukutuku."

#: formats/icon-font/src/index.md
