msgstr "Ko ngā tohu ā-whiu (stroke-based glyphs) (Lucide) ka whakaatuhia hei āhua kī (fills) kia puta hei tohu momotuhi tūturu; ko ngā tohu ā-kī (fill-based glyphs) (Instructure custom) ka tukuna mā te ahua taketake."

