msgid "Build the shared icon-resolver chain: plugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit\n`resolve`, then the built-in pantoken icon set. Used by `@pantoken/rehype` and\n`@pantoken/markdown-it` so the resolution order stays identical across renderers."
msgstr "Hangaia te rārangi whakatau-ikonā ā-waha: tuatahi ngā kai-whakatau kōwhiringa `rehype`, katahi ka `resolve` tika, ā, ko te kete ā-taunoa o ngā ikonā pantoken. E whakamahia ana e `@pantoken/rehype` me\n`@pantoken/markdown-it` kia noho tonu te raupapa whakatau ōrite i ngā kaiwhakarendera katoa."

