msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This is not a second source; it filters the canonical IR from `@pantoken/tokens` to the icon\ntokens and decodes each data-URI back to inline SVG, exposing a shape close to the\n`SimpleIconTokenData` that markdown/rehype consumers already use."
msgstr "Ehara tēnei i te puna tuarua; ka tātari i te IR kanonika mai i `@pantoken/tokens` ki ngā tohu tohu-ā-ata (icon tokens) ā, ka wetewete ia data-URI kia huri anō ki te SVG ā-roto, e whakaatu ana i tētahi āhua e tata ana ki te\n`SimpleIconTokenData` e whakamahia noa ana e ngā kaiwhakamahi markdown/rehype."

