#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a contenteditable field for click-to-edit commit/revert behaviour.\nEnter commits, Escape reverts; blur also commits if the value changed.\nFires a bubbling `change` CustomEvent with `detail.value` on commit."
msgstr "Whakaritea he mara contenteditable mō te whanonga 'pā-ki-te-whakatika' hei whakaū/whakahoki.\nKa whakaū mā te pēhi Enter, ka whakahoki mā te pēhi Escape; ka whakaū anō hoki mēnā i rerekē te uara ina ngaro te aro (blur).\nKa tuku he `change` CustomEvent e peke ana (bubbling) me `detail.value` i te wā e whakaū ana."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element (which IS contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"
msgstr "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element (ko te mea contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"

