#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initRemove()"
msgstr "# Mahi: initRemove()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove a target after a timeout. Before removal, fires a cancelable, bubbling `dismiss` event.\nPreventing that event keeps the target mounted."
msgstr "Tangohia tētahi whāinga i muri i te wā whakamutu. I mua i te tangohanga, ka tukuhia he kaupapa `dismiss` e taea te whakakore, e pupū ana.\nMēnā ka aukati i taua kaupapa, ka piri tonu te whāinga."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The timeout is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless `--timeout` CSS\ncustom property. Missing, non-finite, and non-positive values don't arm a timer. A fade uses the\n`@pantoken/components` `transition` utility's classes (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), then waits\nfor `transitionend` (with a fallback); `transition: \"none\"` removes immediately."
msgstr "Ko te wā whakamutu he kōwhiringa tauhēkona (millisecond) tuhi-taha, he rānei te āhuatanga ritenga CSS kore-wāhanga `--timeout` kua tatauhia mō te whāinga.\nKi te ngaro, ki te kore-mutu, ki te kore utu te uara, kāore e tīmata tētahi taima. Ka whakamahi te whakamama (fade) i ngā kara o te taputapu āwhina `@pantoken/components` `transition` ( `.instui-transition` + `-fade-*` ), katahi ka tatari mō `transitionend` (me tētahi tāwhā tautoko); ka tango tonu a `transition: \"none\"`."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initResponsiveOverlay()"
msgstr "# Mahi: initResponsiveOverlay()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire open/close commands plus width-based responsive overlay switching onto a host: any\ncollapsible side panel (e.g. a drawer's tray) can import this interaction rather than each\ncomponent reimplementing it."
msgstr "Whakauruhia ngā whakahau whakatuwhera/katia me te whakawhiti ā-urupare ā-āwhata i runga i te whanui ki runga i tētahi kaiārahi: katoa\nka taea e tētahi pae taha taea te whakarārangi (hei tauira, te rīhi o tētahi tuwhera) te kawemai i tēnei taunekeneke, kaua ia wahanga e hanga anō i taua mahi."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
