msgstr "Whakakōkiritia te whakaatu/huna mō hover/focus me te tākai wā-roa ki runga i te tooltip wrapper me tana tip\nbubble. Ka hoki mai he mahi horoi (cleanup function) hei whakamahi i te disconnectedCallback o te web component."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  wrapper = .instui-tooltip element, tip = its .tip child\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"
msgstr "  CSS:  wrapper = te wāhanga .instui-tooltip, tip = tana tamaiti .tip\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"

