msgid "### ~~cancelBubble~~"
msgstr "### ~~cancelBubble~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Kua whakamāharatia te rawa **`cancelBubble`** o te atanga Event. Whakamahia Event.stopPropagation() kē. Mēnā ka tautuhia ki te true i mua i te hoki mai i tētahi kaiwhakahaere takahanga, ka ārai i te whakawhānui o te takahanga. I ētahi whakamahinga ā muri ake, kāore he painga ki te tautuhi ki te false. Tirohia te ūnga o te pūtirotiro mō ngā taipitopito."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Deprecated"
msgstr "#### Kua tukuna"

