#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`composed`** o te atanga Event e whakahoki ana i tētahi uara pono/pohehe e tohu ana mēnā ka whakawhānuihia te takahanga ki tāwāhi o te rohe shadow DOM ki te DOM paerewa, kāore rānei."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### currentTarget"
msgstr "### currentTarget"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`currentTarget`** o te atanga Event e tautohu ana i te tūemi i runga i te mea i tāpirihia te kaiwhakahaere takahanga."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### defaultPrevented"
msgstr "### defaultPrevented"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`defaultPrevented`** o te atanga Event e whakahoki ana i tētahi uara pono e tohu ana mēnā i whakakāhore te karanga ki Event.preventDefault()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### eventPhase"
msgstr "### eventPhase"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`eventPhase`** o te atanga Event e tohu ana ko tēhea wāhanga o te rerenga takahanga kei te aromatawai ināianei."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### isTrusted"
msgstr "### isTrusted"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`isTrusted`** o te atanga Event he uara whai/korēnei e tūpono ana ki te true ina i hangaia te takahanga e te kaituku-kaiwhakamahi (tae atu ki ngā mahi a te kaiwhakamahi me ngā tikanga hōtaka pērā i HTMLElement.focus()), ā, he false mēnā i tukuna te takahanga mā EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). Ko te tukunga anake ko te takahanga click, mō tēnei ka tūhurahia te rawa isTrusted ki te false i ngā kaituku-kaiwhakamahi."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~returnValue~~"
msgstr "### ~~returnValue~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Ko te rawa Event **`returnValue`** e tohu ana mēnā kua aukatingia te mahi taunoa mō tēnei takahanga, kāore rānei."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~srcElement~~"
msgstr "### ~~srcElement~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "Ko te **`Event.srcElement`** kua whakamāharatia he ingoa tauwhāiti mō te rawa Event.target. Whakamahia Event.target kē."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`target`** o te atanga Event he whakamārama ki te tūhinga i tukuna ai te takahanga. He rerekē tēnei i te Event.currentTarget ina wa ka karangahia te kaiwhakahaere i te wā e pakaru ana te takahanga i te wā pīrangi (bubbling) hē rānei i te wā whaiwhakarongo (capturing)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### timeStamp"
msgstr "### timeStamp"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`timeStamp`** o te atanga Event e whakahoki ana i te wā (i roto i ngā hēkona-miri) i hanga ai te takahanga."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Ko te rawa pānui-anake **`type`** o te atanga Event e whakahoki ana i tētahi taura e kī ana i te momo o te takahanga. Ka tautuhia i te hanga o te takahanga, ā, koinei te ingoa e whakamahia whānuitia ana hei tohu i te takahanga motuhake, pērā i te click, load, rānei error."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### NONE"
msgstr "### NONE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### AT\\_TARGET"
msgstr "### AT\\_TARGET"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### BUBBLING\\_PHASE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composedPath()"
msgstr "### composedPath()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "Ko te tikanga **`composedPath()`** o te atanga Event e whakahoki ana i te ara o te takahanga, arā, he rārangi o ngā tūhinga ka karangahia ngā whakarongo. Kāore tēnei e whakauru i ngā node o ngā rākau ā-ārai (shadow trees) mēnā i hangaia te pūwāhanga shadow ki te ShadowRoot.mode closed."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~initEvent()~~"
msgstr "### ~~initEvent()~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "Ka whakamahia te tikanga **`Event.initEvent()`** hei whakatū i te uara o tētahi takahanga i hangaia mā te Document.createEvent()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### type"
msgstr "##### type"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### bubbles?"
msgstr "##### bubbles?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "##### cancelable?"
msgstr "##### cancelable?"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### preventDefault()"
msgstr "### preventDefault()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`preventDefault()`** method of the Event interface tells the user agent that the event is being explicitly handled, so its default action, such as page scrolling, link navigation, or pasting text, should not be taken."
msgstr "Ko te tikanga **`preventDefault()`** o te atanga Event e whakamōhio ana ki te kaituku-kaiwhakamahi kei te āta whakahaerehia te takahanga, nō reira kāore e whaihia te mahi taunoa, pērā i te kauwhāki whārangi, te whakatere hono, rānei te whakapiri tuhinga."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopImmediatePropagation()"
msgstr "### stopImmediatePropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents other listeners of the same event from being called."
msgstr "Ko te tikanga **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** o te atanga Event e ārai ana i ētahi atu kaipāho o taua takahanga kia kore e karangahia."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### stopPropagation()"
msgstr "### stopPropagation()"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopPropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents further propagation of the current event in the capturing and bubbling phases. It does not, however, prevent any default behaviors from occurring; for instance, clicks on links are still processed. If you want to stop those behaviors, see the preventDefault() method. It also does not prevent propagation to other event-handlers of the current element. If you want to stop those, see stopImmediatePropagation()."
msgstr "Ko te tikanga **`stopPropagation()`** o te atanga Event e ārai ana i te whakawhānuitanga o te takahanga ināianei i ngā wāhanga hopu (capturing) me te pīrangi (bubbling). Heoi, kāore e aukati i ngā whanonga taunoa; hei tauira, ka noho tonu ngā pāwhiri ki ngā hononga kia whakahaeretia. Mēnā e hiahia ana koe ki te aukati i ēnei whanonga, tirohia te tikanga preventDefault(). Kāore hoki e ārai i te whakawhānuitanga ki ērā atu kaiwhakahaere o taua tūemi. Mēnā e hiahia ana koe ki te aukati i ēnei, tirohia te stopImmediatePropagation()."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: ProgressCircleHandle"
msgstr "# Atanga: ProgressCircleHandle"

