msgid "Build a well-formed [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) from partial input, defaulting `syntax` to `\"*\"` and\n`inherits` to `true`. Plugins import this from `@pantoken/model` to avoid depending on\n`@pantoken/core`; for smart CSS syntax inference use `defineToken` from `@pantoken/core`."
msgstr "Hangaia he [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) kua oti pai i runga i ngā urunga wāhanga, me te tautuhi taunoa i `syntax` ki `\"*\"` me `inherits` ki `true`. Ka kawemai ngā mono (plugins) tēnei mai i `@pantoken/model` kia kore ai e whakawhirinaki ki `@pantoken/core`; mō te aromātai mātauranga o te wetereo CSS, whakamahia `defineToken` mai i `@pantoken/core`."

#: packages/model/src/index.md
