msgid "A shim value comes from EITHER `replacement` (emit `var(replacement)`, so theming flows through) OR\n`value` (freeze the last-known literal, when the drop has no canonical replacement). Exactly one is\nexpected; an entry with neither emits no shim."
msgstr "Ka puta te uara shim nō kotahi o ēnei: `replacement` (tuku `var(replacement)`, kia rere tonu te kaupapa ā-āhua) RĀNEI `value` (whakakōpihia te uara tuhituhi whakamutunga i mōhiotia, mēnā kāore he whakakapinga mana). Kotahi anake te mea e tumanakohia ana; kāore he shim ka puta mēnā kāore te tāurunga e mau i tētahi o ēnei."

