#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# plugin-kit"
msgstr "# plugin-kit"

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — build and compose pantoken plugins, with capability-aware registration."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-kit` — hangaia me te whakarite i ngā mono pantoken, me te rehitatanga e mōhio ana ki ngā āheinga."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) is the modern factory: pass the hooks you implement and it returns a normal\n`PantokenPlugin` branded with the capabilities inferred from those hooks. Consumers\n(`buildTokens`, `toCss`) run [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) to warn — never error — when a plugin is\nregistered where it has no effect: a non-factoried plugin (capability checks unavailable) or a\nfactoried plugin at a stage it doesn't implement (e.g. a token-only plugin passed to `toCss`)."
msgstr "[definePlugin](functions/definePlugin.md) ko te wheketere hou: tukuna ngā hooks ka whakauru koe, ā ka whakahokia mai he `PantokenPlugin` noa kua tapiritia ngā āheinga kua kitea i aua hooks. Ka whakahaere ngā kaihoko (`buildTokens`, `toCss`) i te [checkPlugins](functions/checkPlugins.md) hei whakatūpato — kaua e hapa — ina ka rehitatia tētahi mono kāore he pānga: he mono kāore i whakawhitia ki te wheketere (kāore ngā whakamātautau āheinga) rānei he mono i whakawhitia ki te wheketere mō tētahi wāhanga kāore ia i te whakatinana (hei tauira, he mono mō ngā token anake i tukuna ki `toCss`)."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transform stages a `plugins:` array actually drives are `tokens`, `icons`, and `css`; `rehype`\n(a render-time icon resolver) and `native` (Style Dictionary) are recorded as capabilities but are\ndownstream consumers, not guarded here."
msgstr "Ko ngā wāhanga whakawhitinga e ārahi ana tētahi rārangi `plugins:` ko `tokens`, `icons`, me `css`; kua tuhia ko `rehype` (he kaiwhakatau tohu i te wā whakaatu) me `native` (Style Dictionary) hei āheinga, engari he kaihoko ā-muri ēnei, kāore rānei e tiakina i konei."

#: packages/plugin-kit/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Re-exports [Mode](../../core/src/type-aliases/Mode.md)"
msgstr "Whakahoki anō i te [Mode](../../core/src/type-aliases/Mode.md)"

