#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# utils"
msgstr "# utils"

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken packages: the token\nreference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes (typed via `arkregex`),\nkebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing scale, reference-drift\nvalidation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both `@pantoken/components`\n(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build on. Depends only on\n`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without pulling the GitHub-only\nupstream."
msgstr "`@pantoken/utils` — āwhina tūhonohono, kāore he upstream e tūhono ana, e whakamahia whānuitia ana i ngā tūmomo papāka pantoken: te whakatau tohutoro tohu (me te āhei ki te whakahaere `light-dark()`), ngā rēhita tohu e rua (kua momoia mā `arkregex`), te huri kebab→camel case, te wetewete tae hex, te whakamarutau SVG, te āputa wāhanga pantoken, te whakanekehanga whakaū tohutoro (reference-drift validation), me ngā kaiwhakawhiwhi āhua token→utility-class whānui e hangaia ana e `@pantoken/components` (rōpū tikanga) me `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (rōpū peita mata). E whakawhirinaki ana ki anake `@pantoken/model` (momo) + `arkregex`, nā reira ka taea e tetahi papāka te whakamahi kia kore e kukumea te upstream-a-GitHub."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`\nentry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON load that breaks when\npulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-facing packages (e.g.\n`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."
msgstr "Ko te kaiwhiriwhiri āhua tohu i runga i css-tree kei te kōwae motuhake `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax` te tomokanga, ehara i tēnei pātaka — ka kohia e `css-tree` he utaina JSON `createRequire()` mō te wā runtime e pakaru ana mēnā ka tukua ki roto i tētahi pūkete tīpoki/SSR mō te kaitirotiro, ā, ka kawemai tēnei pātaka e ngā papāka e hāngai ana ki te kaitirotiro (pērā i `@pantoken/components`) mō ngā āwhina kore-Node i runga ake."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add new helpers there and\nre-export them here, don't grow this file."
msgstr "He pātaka mārama — kei ia whakatinanatanga tōna ake kōwae motuhake; tāpirihia ngā āwhina hou ki reira ka kawe-anō ki konei, kaua e whānui ake tēnei kōnae."

