#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# android"
msgstr "# android"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — whakaputa i ngā tapanga hoahoa Instructure hei XML rauemi Android."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Ka whakatāritehia te IR ki ngā uara tūturu, kotahi-āhua (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), katahi ka\nwhakaputa i `res/values/colors.xml` (ngā tapanga tae) me `res/values/dimens.xml` (ngā tapanga ine) mā\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Ka whakamahia e te Style Dictionary ngā huringa Android (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"
msgstr "E ingoa anō ana, e kawe anō ana i te [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"

