#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# canvas-theme-editor"
msgstr "# canvas-theme-editor"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — ngā `theme.css`/`theme.js` kua rite mō te tuku ki te Canvas LMS Theme\nEditor, kua hono tūhono ki te CSS i te CDN o pantoken. Ka whakamahia e `@pantoken/scaffold` te tūāpapa `canvas-theme-editor`; ka taea hoki te whakamahi motuhake."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` ko te putanga taunoa o jsDelivr, kāore i herea — whakamahia [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) kia\narahina ki tētahi atu kaiwhakarato CDN, kia mau i tētahi putanga, kia whakakapi rānei ki ētahi atu rawa pantoken/tuatoru."

