#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CDN provider to build URLs for. Defaults to jsDelivr when omitted."
msgstr "Te kaiwhakarato CDN hei hanga i ngā URL. Ko jsDelivr te taunoa mēnā kāore i whakahuahia."

