#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets. Defaults to [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) for `theme`/`mode`."
msgstr "Ngā rīpene kāhua wāhanga (component-style sheets). Ko [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) te taunoa mō `theme`/`mode`."

