msgstr "Ngā aho kōrero kua whakamāoritia. Ko [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md) te taunoa."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CdnFile"
msgstr "# Atanga: CdnFile"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "He kōnae kotahi hei utaina mai i te CDN, e tautuhia ana mā te ingoa mōkī npm me te ara i roto i taua mōkī."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### package"
msgstr "### package"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "Te ingoa mōkī npm, hei tauira `\"@pantoken/components\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "Te ara i roto i te mōkī, hei tauira `\"dist/components.css\"`. Whakakāhore kia tohu i te pakiaka o te mōkī."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Ka whakakapi i te putanga taumata kaiwhakarato / taumata hanga mō tēnei kōnae anake."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### raw?"
msgstr "### raw?"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "Mō ngā kaiwhakarato e hurihia ana te JS hei taunoa (esm.sh): `false` e āhei ai te kaiwhakarato ki te whakamahi i tana hurihanga ESM noa (e hiahiatia kia `import` i tētahi pūwāhi whakauru tūturu o te mōkī). Mā te taunoa ko `true` — tuku te kōnae pēhitia, he mea tika mō ngā rawa i hanga kē / kāore i te ESM pērā i ngā pepa CSS me ngā kohinga IIFE."

