msgstr "He CDN e taea te whakahaerenga i ngā kōnae pākete npm. Kāore ngā kaiwhakarato e whakaū ingoa pākete i te waea — ka mōhio rātou anake me pēhea te āhua o te URL i tētahi [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."

