msgstr "Te wāhanga Sass (`assets/scss/_pantoken.scss`), te kōnae kāhua noa\n(`assets/css/pantoken.css`), me te kōnae kāhua mō ngā tuhinga (`assets/css/pantoken-prose.css`)."

