#: platforms/hugo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# hugo"
msgstr "# hugo"

#: platforms/hugo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/hugo` — emit the Instructure token stylesheet for a Hugo site."
msgstr "`@pantoken/hugo` — whakaputa te paraupapanga tauira kāhua tohu o Instructure mō tētahi paetukutuku Hugo."

#: platforms/hugo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hugo has no standard theming-variable contract, so this delivers the tokens as drop-in assets\nunder `assets/` (where Hugo Pipes / Dart Sass pick them up): a Sass partial and a plain CSS file\n(from `@pantoken/scss` and `@pantoken/css`), plus an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`) that styles content in a `.pantoken-prose` region."
msgstr "Kāore a Hugo e whai kirimana paerewa mō ngā rerekētanga kaupapa, nō reira ka tukuna ēnei tohu hei rawa tāpiri\ni raro i `assets/` (kei reira ka hopukina e Hugo Pipes / Dart Sass): he wāhanga Sass me tētahi kōnae CSS māmā\n(nō `@pantoken/scss` me `@pantoken/css`), ā, he paraupapanga kāhua mō te kuputuhi āhua InstUI (nō\n`@pantoken/components`) e whakaahua ana i te āhua o te ihirangi i roto i tētahi rohe `.pantoken-prose`."

