msgstr "`@pantoken/jekyll` — whakaputa te kāwai-kāhua token Instructure mō te paetukutuku Jekyll."

#: platforms/jekyll/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Jekyll has no standard theming-variable contract, so this delivers the tokens as drop-in assets:\na Sass partial for `_sass/` (import it from your main stylesheet) and a plain CSS file for\n`assets/css/` (from `@pantoken/scss` and `@pantoken/css`), plus an InstUI-look prose stylesheet\n(from `@pantoken/components`) that styles content in a `.pantoken-prose` region."
msgstr "Kāore a Jekyll i te whai i tētahi kirimana paerewa mō ngā rerekētanga-ā-kāhua, nō reira ka tukuna ēnei token hei rawa tāpirihia:\nhe wahanga Sass mō `_sass/` (ka kawemai i tō kōwhiringa kāhua matua) me tētahi kōnae CSS mārama mō\n`assets/css/` (nā `@pantoken/scss` me `@pantoken/css`), ā, tētahi pepapāho ā-kupu āhua InstUI\n(nō `@pantoken/components`) e whakarite ana i te āhua o ngā ihirangi i roto i tētahi rohe `.pantoken-prose`."

