#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When an upstream release drops a `--instui-*` token, a hand-authored `DeprecationLedger`\nrecords its lifecycle: when it was deprecated, the upstream minor that will remove it, and how to\nkeep it working meanwhile — either forward to a canonical token (`replacement` → `var(...)`) or\nfreeze its last-known literal (`value`). This plugin appends one shim token per entry. Because the\nshim is a single `var(...)` or a plain value, `defineToken` records its `refersTo`/syntax and\n`toCss` emits it, so the shim rides into css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanilla with no extra wiring."
msgstr "Ina ka whakakorehia e tētahi putanga upstream tētahi token `--instui-*`, ka tuhi tētahi `DeprecationLedger` ā-ringa\ntōna oranga: i te wā i whakamāharatia, te tau minor upstream ka tango i taua token, me pēhea te\nwhakamana i tōna mahi i taua wā — mā te whakamārohirohi ki tētahi token kōnei (`replacement` → `var(...)`) rānei\nmā te whakamātautau i tōna tohu whakamutunga (`value`). Ko tēnei pūrere tāpiri i tētahi token shim kotahi mō ia rēhitatanga. Nā te mea\nhe kotahi noa te shim he `var(...)`, he uara noa rānei, ka tuhi `defineToken` tōna `refersTo`/wetereo, ā, ka tukuna e\n`toCss`, nō reira ka uru te shim ki css/scss/less/stylus/wordpress/vanilla me te kore taura atu."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The retirement is enforced elsewhere (the upgrade pipeline hard-fails a bump once an entry's\n`removeIn` upstream minor is reached, forcing the entry to be retired and a consumer minor cut).\n[dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) is the check that powers it; [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) powers the docs."
msgstr "Kei ērā atu wāhi te whakatinanatanga o te reti — ka pakaru te tukanga whakahou (upgrade pipeline) ina tae ki te minor upstream kua mōhiotia mō te rēhitatanga,\nā, ka aukati kia retihia te rēhitatanga me te waihanga i tētahi putanga minor mō te kaihoko. Ko [dueForRemoval](functions/dueForRemoval.md) te tirohanga e tautoko ana i tēnei; ko [describeLifecycle](functions/describeLifecycle.md) te mea e whakamārama ana i ngā tuhinga."

#: plugins/pantoken/deprecations/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [deprecationShims](functions/deprecationShims.md)"
msgstr "Ingoa-ana kia rere anō, me te kawe anō i te [deprecationShims](functions/deprecationShims.md)"

