msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw pantoken primitive palette (`--instui-primitive-*`)."
msgstr "Ngā karaehe āwhina kōwhiri (opt‑in) mō te papa tae pūtake raw o pantoken (`--instui-primitive-*`)."

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The semantic utilities in `@pantoken/components` deliberately expose only semantic tokens — a color\noverride there is always a role (`bg-brand`), never a raw swatch. This package is the escape hatch:\none class per primitive token for the rare case a developer needs the palette directly. Load it on\nits own (`@pantoken/plugin-primitives/primitives.css`), separate from the semantic layer."
msgstr "Ko ngā taputapu tikanga i roto i `@pantoken/components` e whakaatu atu ana i ngā tohu tikanga anake — ko te huringa tae i reira he wāhi tonu (`bg-brand`), ehara i te kāri tae raw. He huarahi whakatā tēnei mō taua āhuatanga: kotahi karaehe mō ia tohu pūtake mō te wāheke noa ka hiahia te kaihanga rorohiko ki te whakamahi tika i te papa. Whakahohehia anake ia (`@pantoken/plugin-primitives/primitives.css`), wehe mai i te paparanga tikanga."

