msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-transition` — ngā `--instui-transition-duration`/`--instui-transition-timing`\nngā token kei muri i te taputapu `Transition` o InstUI."

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS itself (the `.instui-transition` base rule plus the `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*` state classes)\nlives in `@pantoken/components`' own `transition` utility now; this plugin only bakes the two\nduration/timing tokens into a token IR for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens` pipeline directly."
msgstr "Ko te CSS anō (te ture taketake `.instui-transition` me ngā karaehe ā-āhua `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*`)\nkei roto i te ake taputapu `transition` o `@pantoken/components` ināianei; ko tēnei pūtirotiro anake e tāpiri ana i ngā tohu roa/wā e rua ki roto i te IR tohu mō ngā kaiwhakamahi e whakamahi tika ana i te raina mahi `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens`."

