msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-visual-debug` — te CSS mō te prop `withVisualDebug` o InstUI."

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI's layout primitives (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) take `withVisualDebug` to outline the box\nand its children while debugging a layout. This plugin emits a single dash-prefixed modifier,\n`-with-visual-debug`, that works on any element (compound with any base, e.g.\n`.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). The outline colour is a `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` custom property\n(default a bright magenta) so it's easy to retint."
msgstr "Ko ngā mātāpono ā-rauemi a InstUI (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) ka whakamahi i te `withVisualDebug` hei whakamārama i te pouaka me ōna tamariki i te wā e wetewete ana i te tatauranga. Ka whakaputa tēnei pūtirotiro he kaiwhakatika kotahi kua tīmata ki te taraiwa (dash-prefixed), `-with-visual-debug`, e mahi ana ki runga i tētahi elemene (ka taea te hono ki tētahi turanga katoa, hei tauira `.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). Ko te tae ā-ake he rawa ritenga `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` (taunoa he karaka-māwhero kanapa) kia māmā ai te huri tae."

