#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@property` at-rules register typed CSS custom properties with `syntax`, `inherits`, and\n`initial-value` descriptors. They carry significant byte overhead — ~60 bytes of boilerplate per\nproperty — and are unnecessary when the stylesheet is a self-contained bundle where type\nregistration provides no runtime benefit. This plugin replaces each `@property` block with a\nsimple `--name: value` declaration inside a chosen selector, recovering all that overhead."
msgstr "Ngā at-rule `@property` e rēhita ana i ngā rawa ritenga CSS whai momo mā ngā whakaahuatanga `syntax`, `inherits`, me `initial-value`. He nui tō rātou utu pitopito kōnae — tata ki te 60 pātene mō ia rawa — ā, kāore e hiahiatia ana mēnā he pūtau kotahi te paparanga ārahi ā–tiraa (stylesheet) kaore hoki he painga mō te rēhitatanga momo i te wā whakahaere. Ka whakakapi tēnei pūtahuri i ia tūnga `@property` ki tētahi tauākī `--name: value` noa i roto i tētahi kairēhita kua whiriwhiria, kia whakahokia mai ngā utu pitopito katoa."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Semantic note:** removing `@property` loses CSS type registration. Typed transitions/animations,\n`@starting-style`, and the CSS Typed OM depend on it. Only apply to bundles where those semantics\nare not needed."
msgstr "**Tuhipānga ā-wairua:** ka tangohia te `@property` ka ngaro te rēhitatanga momo CSS. Kei runga i tēnei rēhitatanga ngā whakawhitinga/aho huringa (typed transitions/animations), `@starting-style`, me te CSS Typed OM. Whakamahia anake tēnei ki ngā pūtau (bundles) kāore ēnei tikanga e hiahiatia."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: FlattenPropertyOptions"
msgstr "# Atanga: FlattenPropertyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."
msgstr "Ngā kōwhiringa mō [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### injectSelector?"
msgstr "### injectSelector?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The selector of the rule that receives the extracted `--name: value` declarations."
msgstr "Te kaitohu (selector) o te ture e whiwhi ana i ngā whakapuakitanga `--name: value` kua tangohia."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Default Value"
msgstr "#### Uara Taunoa"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### onMissingInitialValue?"
msgstr "### onMissingInitialValue?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What to do with an `@property` at-rule that has no `initial-value` descriptor."
msgstr "He aha te mahi mō tētahi at-rule `@property` kāore he whakaahuatanga `initial-value`."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"remove\"` — drop the at-rule (default).\n- `\"keep\"` — leave it in the output untouched."
msgstr "- `\"remove\"` — mukua te at-rule (taunoa).\n- `\"keep\"` — waiho i te putanga kia kore e whakarereketia."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: flattenProperty"
msgstr "# Taipūtī: flattenProperty"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the flatten-`@property` PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Hangaia te taapiri PostCSS flatten-`@property`."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Walks all `@property` at-rules in the stylesheet, extracts each `initial-value` descriptor, removes\nthe at-rule, and prepends a single `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` rule containing all\nextracted declarations. Empty rules and `@layer` blocks left behind after removal are dropped."
msgstr "Haerehia ngā at-rule `@property` katoa i te raupapa kāhua, tangohia ia whakamārama `initial-value`, whakamokohia te at-rule, ā, whakamuahia tētahi ture `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` kotahi e rongo ana i ngā tuhinga kua tangohia.\nKa whakahēhia ngā ture kāhore he ihirangi me ngā poraka `@layer` i toe i muri i te tangohanga."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Default injection into :root**"
msgstr "**Tāpokina taunoa ki roto i :root**"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inject into :scope (for use inside scope blocks)**"
msgstr "**Tāpokina ki :scope (mō te whakamahi i roto i ngā poraka scope)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# mangle-custom-props"
msgstr "# mangle-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — ingoa anō i ngā ingoa rawa roa o ngā taonga ritenga ki ngā tuakiri raupapa poto."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "Ko ngā ingoa tūonga pērā i `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` he mārama ki te tangata engari he utu nui i roto i ngā kohinga kua whakaitihia: ko te ingoa anō he 40+ pātene, ka whakahuatia i te tautuhinga, ia wā e karangahia ana e `var()`, me ia rēhitatanga o `@property`. Ka whakakapi tēnei tāpiri i ia ingoa e rite ana — puta noa i ngā tautuhinga, ngā tohutoro `var()`, me ngā tawhā `@property` — ki tētahi tuakiri poto (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`, …), e whakaheke ana i te taumaha o ngā ingoa e pā ana ki te ~90%."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "Ka kohia ngā ingoa mai i te kāhua-kōwae (stylesheet) katoa, ka raupapahia ā-āpitihanga whakarārangi mō tētahi mappi pūmau, ā, ka tuku raupapa ki ia kotahi. He kōwhiringa [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) e āhei ana kia tiritiria tētahi mapi kotahi e ngā whakawhitinga PostCSS motuhake maha, kia haumaru ai te mangling o ngā kōnae CSS kua tukatuka wehe ka utaina tahi, me te whakamahi i ngā ingoa kotahi."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"
msgstr "# Atanga: MangleCustomPropsOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Ngā kōwhiringa mō [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Ko ngā ingoa taonga ritenga anake e tīmata ana ki tēnei aho ka hurihia."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### method?"
msgstr "### method?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "Te algorima e whakamahia hei hanga ingoa whakakapi poto."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (taunoa; te poto rawa mō ngā huinga nui)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (ā-tuhinga me ngā tau)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### propertyMap?"
msgstr "### propertyMap?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "Ina `true`, ka tāpiri he tāuru `mangle-map` ki te `result.messages` o PostCSS i muri i te tukatuka.\nKo te āhua o te karere: `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### sharedManifest?"
msgstr "### sharedManifest?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "He `Map` ka taea te whakarerekē e tohaina ana i waenga i ngā whakawhēra PostCSS maha."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "I ia whakawhēra ka pānui te pūtukatuka i ngā tāuru e tū ana (ka whakamahi anō i ō rātou ingoa poto) ka tuhi i ngā tāuru hou (e whai tonu ana i te kauntara mai i `sharedManifest.size`). Tukuna taua tauira `Map` kotahi ki ia karanga `mangleCustomProps` rānei `applyMinify` e tukatuka ana i ngā kōnae CSS ka utaina tahi i roto i te kaitirotiro — mā tēnei ka whakaritea e ngā kōnae katoa te mappinga ingoa kotahi."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "Tukatuka i te pepa tohu tuatahi kia whakatītina ōna ingoa ki te manifest i mua i te tāpiri e ngā pepa wāhanga i ō rātou tohutoro (e nuinga ake ka whakawhāiti)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: MangleMethod"
msgstr "# Ingoa momo: MangleMethod"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Rautaki hanga ingoa poto mō [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: mangleCustomProps"
msgstr "# Taipūtī: mangleCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Hangaia te mono PostCSS mangle-custom-properties."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "Ka kohi i ngā ingoa rawa ritenga katoa e hāngai ana ki `prefix` mai i ngā prop whakapuaki, ngā tohutoro `var()`, me ngā pārameta `@property`. Ka raupapa rātou kia ā-tika, kia pumau ai te mapi, katahi ka tohua ngā ingoa poto mā te whakamahi i te `method`. Ka whakakapi i ia tukunga puta noa i te raupapa-kāhua."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Whakamāngia me ngā tautuhinga taunoa (--instui-\\\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Tūhonohia te mapi ki ngā kōnae e rua ka utaina tahi**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**Whakamahia ngā ingoa base36, ka whakaputa i te mapi mā result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: applyMinify()"
msgstr "# Mahi: applyMinify()"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Whakamahia ngā whakarerekētanga whakaiti mō ngā custom-property ki runga i tētahi rārangi stylesheet."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "Hangaia he rārangi mono PostCSS nō `options` ka whakahaerehia kia rite tonu. Te raupapa mono:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Ka whakahoki i te urunga kia kore e huri mēnā kāore he kōwhiringa kua tautuhia."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "Te rārangi stylesheet hei huri."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "Te rārangi CSS kua hurihia."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — whakaritea ngā huringa prune, flatten, me mangle mō\n`--instui-*` custom properties mā te taputapu kotahi [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Ia putorino tuku CSS (generate scripts, renderers) ka whakamahi i `applyMinify` mō te mata\nwhakakākahu pūmau, kāore e tango i te whakawhirinaki tika ki PostCSS."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**He haumaru anake te Prune + mangle mō ngā kohinga tūmatanui** i reira katoa ngā tohu `var(--instui-*)`\nand their definitions live in the same output. Mō ngā kaiwhakamahi kōnae motuhake (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), whakamahia ko `{ flatten: true }` anake."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Mangle across file boundaries:** tukuna te pūrongo `Map` kotahi hei\n`mangle.sharedManifest` ki ia waea `applyMinify` e tukatuka ana i ngā kōnae CSS e uta tahi ana.\nTukatuka tuatahi te pepa tohu (ka whakatō i te manifest), katahi ngā pepa rāngai."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Whakamahia ngā huringa e toru ki tētahi kohinga tūmatanui**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Flatten anake (he haumaru mō ngā kaiwhakamahi kōnae motuhake)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Mangle i ngā kōnae e rua me taua mapi kotahi**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"
msgstr "# Atanga: PropsMinifyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Ngā kōwhiringa mō [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prune?"
msgstr "### prune?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "Whakamahia [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) kia whakakore i ngā tohu `--instui-*` kāore e whakamahia i mua i ētahi atu hurihanga."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "He haumaru anake mō ngā kohinga motuhake e whai ana i ngā tautuhinga tohu me ngā ture wāhanga e whakahāngai ana ki a rātou. Ko te tango i tētahi raupapa tohu-anake ka whakakore i ngā mea katoa."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### flatten?"
msgstr "### flatten?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "Whakamahia [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) kia hurihia ngā at-rules `@property` ki ngā whakapuakitanga mārama."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` e whakamahi ana i ngā taunoa o te plugin (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`). Tukua he tūtohi [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) kia whakarerekē i ia taunoa."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### mangle?"
msgstr "### mangle?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "Whakamahia [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) kia whakakapihia ngā ingoa roa `--instui-*` ki ngā tohu poto."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` e whakamahi ana i ngā taunoa o te plugin (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`). Tukua he tūtohi [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) kia whakarerekē i ia taunoa — tae atu ki `sharedManifest` mō te whakaritenga i waenga i ngā kōnae."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
