msgid "# prune-custom-props"
msgstr "# prune-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties from a composed\nstylesheet."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tangohia (tree-shake) ngā rawa ritenga kāore e whakamahia mai i tētahi\nkōwae kāhua."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 icon data-URIs\nincluded). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of the system would\notherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting from the `var()`\nreferences in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps only the custom\nproperties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` registrations."
msgstr "Ko te `@pantoken/css` o pantoken e whakaputa ana i te katoa o te kohinga tohu `--instui-*` (≈1,800 ngā raraunga icon-URI kua oti te whakauru). Mēnā he kaitārua e hanga ana i runga i taua paparanga engari e whakarite ana i tētahi wahanga noa o te pūnaha, ka tukuna atu e ia te kohinga katoa — nō reira he hiahia tō ia kaitārua pērā. Mai i ngā tohutoro `var()` i roto i ngā whakatauhinga tūturu (kāore he rawa ritenga), ka pupuri anake ngā rawa ritenga e taea ana te toro ihorere, ā, ka whakahekehia ngā rekoata `@property` kāore e whakamahia."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The factory returns a\nplain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency — `postcss` is only\na type."
msgstr "He āpitihanga PostCSS tū motuhake tēnei (whakamahia i tō ake whatunga PostCSS). Ko te wheiao e hoki mai ana he tūtohu āpitihanga mārama, nō reira kāore he whakawhirinaki runtime ka whakahokia — he momo anake te `postcss`."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
