#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — a Vite dev-server plugin that watches upstream workspace\npackages and rebuilds them (and their dependents) when source changes."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — he mono Vite dev-server e mātaki ana i ngā mōkī mahi-ā-ātea o runga ka hanga anō i aua mōkī (me ā rātou whakawhirinaki) ina huri ngā puna."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "During development, changes to a local workspace package normally need a manual rebuild before the\ndev server reflects them. This plugin automates that: it watches each upstream package's source\nwith native `fs.watch` (not Vite's chokidar, which filters paths outside the project root),\ndebounces rapid changes, rebuilds in topological order, and registers built output with Vite's\nwatcher so the browser reloads. In pantoken's docs it keeps the generated CSS (`@pantoken/css`,\n`@pantoken/components`) fresh as you edit the libraries, instead of only at build time."
msgstr "I te wā whakawhanake, he tikanga kia hanga ā-ringa anō tētahi mōkī mahi-ā-rohe i mua i te kitea e te tūmau dev ngā panoni. Ka whakakāhorehia e tēnei mono taua mahi: ka mātaki ia i te puna o ia mōkī o runga mā te `fs.watch` ā-taiao (ehara i te chokidar o Vite, e tātaritia ana ngā ara kei waho i te pūtake kaupapa), ka whakangāwari i ngā panoni tere, ka hanga anō i runga i te raupapa toporo, ā, ka rāhuitia ngā putanga kua hanga ki te kaitirotiro a Vite kia whakahou anō te kaitirotiro tukutuku. I roto i ngā tuhinga o pantoken, ka pūmau ia i te CSS i hangaia (`@pantoken/css`, `@pantoken/components`) kia hou i a koe e whakarerekē ana i ngā whare pukapuka, kāore noa i te wā hanga."

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It applies during `serve` only, so production builds are untouched."
msgstr "Ka whai tērā i te wā `serve` anake, nō reira kāore e pāngia ngā hanga whakaputa."

