msgstr "Ka mahi tahi ki ngā whare pukapuka katoa e pānui ana i tētahi kaupapa mai i `props.theme` — ko Emotion, styled-components, me Stitches e whakamahia ana taua tikanga. Ko [pantokenTheme](variables/pantokenTheme.md) te tūnga `rebrand` kua oti kē, ā, he tautoko var() kia rere te whakawhitinga mārama/pango mā `@pantoken/css`. Ka hanga e [toStyledTheme](functions/toStyledTheme.md) tētahi mai i tētahi IR (ā, ka taea hoki te horoi/tāpae i ngā uara konkreti mā `{ resolve }`)."

