msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — kaupapa Foundation for Sites me ngā tohu Instructure."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "He tuatahi ā Foundation ki te Sass, nō reira ka kawea e tēnei kete e rua ngā paparanga. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) ka whakaputa i tētahi haurua Sass āhanga `_settings` e tohu ana i ngā tawhā tautuhinga o Foundation ki `var(--instui-*)`, kia taea ai e te hanga Sass te kohi i te āhua Instructure ā, kia mau tonu te whakamahinga ā-wā (runtime) mā ngā rawa ritenga kotahi. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) ka whakaputa i tētahi kupenga CSS huhua e whakarite ana i ngā kara o ngā karaanga kua whakaotihia (`.button`, `.callout`, hononga) i taua ara — he whaihua mēnā ka whakamahi koe i te CSS paerewa o Foundation me hiahia noa ki te taupoki i ngā tae Instructure kei runga, me te kore e hanga anō."

