msgstr "# markdown-it"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — a markdown-it plugin that renders `:icon:` codes as inline SVG and\nstandalone color values (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) as swatches, using the pantoken icon\nset."
msgstr "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — he tāpiri mō markdown-it e whakaatu ana i ngā waehere `:icon:` hei SVG ā-roto, me ngā uara tae motuhake (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) hei tauira tae, mā te whakamahi i te kohinga tohu pantoken."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ports the `@pantoken/rehype` and `@pantoken/react-markdown` pipelines onto markdown-it: a\nsingle core rule walks each inline token's text children, splits them on the icon and color\npatterns, and swaps the matches for `html_inline` tokens. Icon codes resolve through a chain —\nplugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), then the\nbuilt-in `@pantoken/icons` set — so brand-icon plugins compose the same way they do elsewhere."
msgstr "Ka kawea ngā riu `@pantoken/rehype` me `@pantoken/react-markdown` ki runga i te markdown-it: he ture matua kotahi e hīkoi ana i ngā tamariki kuputuhi o ia tohu ā-roto, e wehe ana i a rātou i runga i ngā tauira ata me ngā tauira tae, ā, ka whakawhitihia ngā kitenga ki ngā tohu `html_inline`. Ka whakatauhia ngā waehere ata mā te mekameka — tuatahi ko ngā whakamārama ā-āpitihanga `rehype`, katahi te [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve) kua tautuhia, ā, kātahi ko te kohinga ā-roto `@pantoken/icons` — nō reira ka hanga tahi ngā taonga-marka ā-ata i te ara kotahi e hangaia ai ērā i ētahi atu wāhi."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The emitted markup uses the same class names as the other renderers (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), so loading `@pantoken/components` styles it. Wrap the rendered HTML in a\n`.pantoken-prose` container (see [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) to pick up the prose layer too."
msgstr "Ko te tohu HTML kua whakaputaina e whakamahi ana i ngā ingoa kāwai ōrite ki ērā o ērā atu kaiwhakaatu (`pantoken-icon`, `pantoken-color-swatch`), nō reira mā te uta i `@pantoken/components` ka whakatakoto āna kāhua. Whakakīa te HTML kua whakamahia ki roto i tētahi ipu `.pantoken-prose` (tīpakohia te [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) kia hopukina hoki te papa kōrero."

