#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — he tūmomo kāhua ā-ao ā-Instructure mō ngā aratohu Pendo."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
msgstr "Ka whakapiri a Pendo i te HTML aratohu ki te whārangi kaiwhakarere; ka whakaputa tēnei i taua DOM aratohu (`._pendo-*`) kia rite ki Instructure UI, mā te whakamahi i te paparanga tohu `--instui-*` a pantoken mō te whakakotahitanga. Kei roto he āhua urupare mō ngā pae kōwhai and moana mō ngā aratohu, me ngā whakatūpato, popover, rangahau, me ngā mana whakahaere. I whakawhitihia te CSS waahanga ki te `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; ko pantoken te kaiwhakarato i ngā tohu me te hanga. Ka whakahohehia te kauwhata ākauroa mā te kāwai kaupapa kotahi e mau ana i `instui`; ka tīpako ngā taera pahi me ngā āwhina āhua mā ngā whakapiringa poto i runga i taua kāwai."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) e whakahōputu ana i te kāhua; ko [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) te hanga `rebrand` kua rite (ā-paewhānui, `!important`). Ka whakaputahia tētahi kōnae pūmau kei `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"
msgstr "E ingoa hou ana, e kaweake anō ana i a [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"

