msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Tāpiri i `!important` ki ngā whakamōhiotanga wahanga kia tū rangatira ai rātou ki ngā kāhua o Pendo (taunoa `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Whakakorehia mā te tree-shake ngā tohu `--instui-*` kāore e whakamahia (taunoa `true`; mēnā kāore e whakahohe ka tukuna te huinga tohu katoa)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Huri ngā ture @ `@property` ki ngā whakaaturanga whāiti o ngā tauranga ritenga mā te whakamahi i\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (taunoa `false`). Ka whakamahi a `true` i ngā taunoa mono me\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` kia hono ai ngā tauākī ki roto i te poraka `@scope`.\nTukuna he tūtohi [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) kia whakawātea i ngā taunoa takitahi."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Huri ngā ingoa `--instui-*` ki ngā tautuhi pūtake-26 iti rawa mā te whakamahi i [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(taunoa `false`). He haumaru tēnei i konei nā te mea he kohinga motuhake te huinga tohu me te pānui ā-wahanga. Tukuna he tūtohi [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) kia whakawātea i ngā taunoa."

