#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin that wraps standalone color values in `<span data-color-code=\"…\">`, so the React\nlayer can render a swatch. Mirrors the icon-token pipeline."
msgstr "He tāpiritanga rehype e takai ana i ngā uara tae motuhake ki roto i `<span data-color-code=\"…\">`, kia taea e te React\npaparanga te whakaatu i tētahi tauira tae. He whakaata tēnei i te paipa icon-token."

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/rehypeGithubAlerts.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: rehypeGithubAlerts()"
msgstr "# Mahi: rehypeGithubAlerts()"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/rehypeGithubAlerts.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin that tags GitHub-alert blockquotes: it detects a `[!NOTE]`-style marker at the\nstart of a blockquote, records it as `data-alert=\"note\"`, and strips the marker text. The React\n`blockquote` component then renders an InstUI `Alert`."
msgstr "He etita rehype e tohu ana i ngā blockquote whakatūpato o GitHub: ka kitea tētahi tohu ā-`[!NOTE]` i te timatanga o te blockquote, ka tārua hei `data-alert=\"note\"`, ā, ka tangohia te kuputuhi tohu. Ka whakairohia e te wahanga React `blockquote` te `Alert` o InstUI."

