msgid "# react-markdown"
msgstr "# react-markdown"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/react-markdown` — render Markdown with Instructure UI components and pantoken icons."
msgstr "`@pantoken/react-markdown` — whakaatu Markdown me ngā wāhanga UI o Instructure me ngā tohu pantoken."

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default entry renders GitHub-Flavored Markdown, inline `:icon:` tokens (via\n`@pantoken/rehype` + `@pantoken/icons`), color-code swatches, and GitHub-style alerts. The MDX\nprovider lives at `@pantoken/react-markdown/mdx`."
msgstr "Ko te tomokanga taunoa e whakaatu ana i te GitHub-Flavored Markdown, ngā tohu `:icon:` i roto i te rārangi (ma te\n`@pantoken/rehype` + `@pantoken/icons`), ngā tauira tae ā-āhua, me ngā whakatūpato ā-taera GitHub. Kei `@pantoken/react-markdown/mdx` te kaiwhakarato MDX."

