#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/react-native` — Instructure design tokens as React Native `StyleSheet`-friendly\nobjects. React Native has no CSS variables, so tokens are fully resolved to concrete values:\ncolours stay hex strings, dimensions become numbers (dp), and icons are excluded."
msgstr "`@pantoken/react-native` — Ngā token hoahoa o Instructure hei āhuatanga hāngai ki React Native `StyleSheet`-friendly\nēnei tūnga. Kāore a React Native e whai rerekētanga CSS, nō reira ka whakatau katoa ngā token ki ngā uara mārama:\nka noho ngā tae hei aho hex, ka riro ngā inenga hei tau (dp), ā, ka whakakorehia ngā tohu."

