msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/rehype` — render `:icon:` codes as inline SVG."
msgstr "`@pantoken/rehype` — whakaatu `:icon:` waehere hei SVG whakauru."

#: renderers/rehype/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin walks hast text nodes and replaces `:code:` tokens with an inline SVG element,\nresolving each code through a chain: plugin `rehype` resolvers first, then any explicit\n`resolve`, then the built-in `@pantoken/icons` set. It ports `rehype-instui-markdown` onto the\nshared icon manifest."
msgstr "Kei te hīkoi te mono i ngā pūtau kuputuhi hast ka whakakapi i ngā tohu `:code:` ki tētahi āhuatanga SVG whakauru,\nka whakamārama i ia waehere mā te rārangi: tuatahi ngā kaiwhakamāori `rehype` o te mono, katahi ngā `resolve` mārama, ā, ka mutu ko te huinga ā-tūnga `@pantoken/icons`. Ka kawea atu te `rehype-instui-markdown` ki te rārangi tohu tuku-nui."

#: renderers/rehype/src/index.md
