msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base CSS selector — a class (`.button`), attribute (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n or shadow-DOM pseudo (`:host`) — inferred from the first bare-class rule or set explicitly via\n `@selector`. Always non-empty (falls back to `.${name}` when inference fails)."
msgstr "Te kōwhiringa CSS turanga — he akomanga (`.button`), he āhuatanga (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), he ID (`#foo`),\nhe pseudo shadow-DOM (`:host`) — i whakatatau mā te ture akomanga rawaka tuatahi, ā, ka tautuhia rānei mā\n`@selector`. Kāore e kore he kore-kore (ka huri ki `.${name}` mēnā kāore te whakatau i pai)."

