#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: buildRegisterContext()"
msgstr "# Mahi: buildRegisterContext()"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the shared [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) a `register()`-style call threads to every element's\n`define`. The icon resolver is injectable: `register()` always passes the real,\n`@pantoken/icons`-backed [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (unchanged default behavior for every existing caller),\nwhile the per-element CDN build passes [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) for elements that never call it —\n`@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` is a multi-MB dependency, and since Rollup can't code-split\n`iife`/`umd` output, anything statically reachable from a bundle's entry ends up in the whole\nbundle, regardless of whether that specific element's code path ever invokes it. This module has no\ntop-level side effects for exactly that reason — importing it (unlike importing `../index.ts`, which\nauto-registers everything on import) never reaches [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) unless the caller passes it in."
msgstr "Hangaia te [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) ā-roa he waea ā-`register()` ki ia āhuatanga ki te\n`define`. Ka taea te whakauru i te whakatau tohu: ko `register()` ka tuku tonu i te tino,\n`@pantoken/icons`-taapirihia [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (koinei te whanonga taunoa ka kore e huri mō ia kaitaunaki o nāianei),\nina rā ko te hanga CDN mō ia āhuatanga ka tuku i [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) mō ngā āhuatanga kāore tahi e karanga —\nko `@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` he whakawhirinaki rahi-MB, ā, i te mea kāore e taea e Rollup te wewete-waehere\n`iife`/`umd` whakaputanga, ka riro i te pōkai katoa ngā mea ka taea te toro kia ā-taupānga mai i te tomokanga o te pōkai,\nahakoa mēnā kāore te rori waehere o tērā āhuatanga ka karanga i taua wā. Kāore tēnei mōkihi e whai pānga taumata-tihi mō tēnei take —\nko te kawemai i a ia (hēke ki te kawemai i `../index.ts`, e rēhita aunoa ana i ngā mea katoa i te kawemai) kāore e tae ki [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)\nmēnā kāore te kaitaunaki e tuku mai."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Same shape as `register()`'s options, minus `only`."
msgstr "Te āhua kotahi pēnei i ngā kōwhiringa o `register()`, engari kāore he `only`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
