msgid "The registry to define into."
msgstr "Te rēhita hei tautuhi ki roto."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### resolveIconSvg"
msgstr "### resolveIconSvg"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The resolver wired into `ctx.iconSvg` — pass [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) for real icons\n  or [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) when the caller's element set provably never renders one (see\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` in `./elements-meta.ts`)."
msgstr "Te whakatau e herea ki `ctx.iconSvg` — tukuna [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) mō ngā tohu tūturu\n  rānei [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) mēnā kua whakamanahia e te huinga āhuatanga o te kaitaunaki kāore rātou e whakakite i tētahi (tīkina atu\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` i roto i `./elements-meta.ts`)."

