msgid "Format an MF2 `source` message for `locale`, substituting `params`. Throws on invalid MF2 syntax\n— validate with `@pantoken/i18n-engine`'s `validateMf2` at build time, not at format time."
msgstr "Hōputu i tētahi karere MF2 `source` mō `locale`, e whakakapi ana i `params`. Ka whiua he hapa mēnā he hē te wetereo MF2\n— whakamanahia ki te `@pantoken/i18n-engine`'s `validateMf2` i te wā hanga, kaua i te wā e hōputu ana."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatMessage.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
