#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/isolate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap `value` in Unicode bidi isolates (FSI/PDI) so it doesn't scramble the surrounding text's\ndirection — e.g. a Latin filename embedded in an Arabic sentence built with plain string\nconcatenation. `formatMessage` already does this for MF2 placeholders; use `isolate` only when\ninterpolating outside MF2."
msgstr "Whakakīia `value` ki roto i ngā isolate bidi o Unicode (FSI/PDI) kia kaua e raruraru te aronga o te kuputuhi e karapoti ana — hei tauira, he ingoa kōnae Rātini (Latin) i whakauruhia ki roto i tētahi rerenga Arapi kua hangaia mā te whakaeke aho noa. `formatMessage` kua mahia kē tēnei mō ngā tauwhāinga MF2; whakamahia `isolate` anake mēnā kei waho o MF2 koe e whakakī ana."

