msgid "Build a `WebComponentStrings` object for `locale`.\nWeekday names are derived from `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (and rotated to the locale's first day of\nweek); all other strings fall back to English unless provided in `overrides`."
msgstr "Hangaia tētahi tūāhua `WebComponentStrings` mō `locale`.\nKo ngā ingoa rā o te wiki e ahu mai i `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (ā, ka hurihia kia tīmata i te rā tuatahi o te wiki mō te rohe); ka hokingia ngā taonga kōrero katoa ki te reo Ingarihi mēnā kāore i whakaratoa i `overrides`."

