msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Ka whakaae i tētahi [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) kua oti te whakaū *rānei* he taura tapanga BCP47 mata. Mēnā ka whiua he taura,\nka tango e [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) ngā ingoa o ngā rā mā te whakamahi i `Intl.DateTimeFormat` ā, ko ērā atu taura ka huri atu ki te Reo Pākehā; tukuna he bundle mō ngā whakamāoritanga katoa."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
