#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invoked in the browser) defines the full `<instui-*>` element set into\nany custom-element registry. Each element renders the matching `@pantoken/components` CSS into\nits shadow root; tokens are inherited custom properties that pierce the shadow boundary — load\n`@pantoken/css` to supply them."
msgstr "[register](functions/register.md) (ka karangahia aunoa i te kaitirotiro) e tautuhia te huinga katoa o ngā waahanga `<instui-*>` ki roto\nki tētahi rehita taonga ritenga. Ia wāhanga ka whakaatu i te `@pantoken/components` CSS e hāngai ana ki roto\ni tōna pakiaka atarangi; ko ngā tohu he rawa ritenga tūmataiti ka whakawhānui i te rohe atarangi — uta\n`@pantoken/css` kia whakarato i ēnei."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."
msgstr "Mō ngā aho UI kua ā-rohe (ngā tapanga whakatere marama i te maramataka, te tuhi wāhi rā mō te urunga rā, te kuputuhi ‘Back’ i te drilldown) tuku ngā kōwhiringa `locale`, `strings`, rānei `dir` ki te [register](functions/register.md). Ka kawea mai anō i tēnei kete te huinga katoa o ngā kohinga taurite Canvas me te āwhina [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The module is Node-safe: element classes are defined inside [register](functions/register.md), a no-op when there\nis no DOM, so importing during SSR or a build never touches `HTMLElement`."
msgstr "He haumaru te wāhanga mō Node: ka tautuhia ngā karaehe o ngā waahanga i roto i te [register](functions/register.md), he mahi kore ina\nkāore he DOM, nō reira kāore te kawemai i te wā SSR, i te wā hanga rānei e pa atu ki `HTMLElement`."

