msgid "The shared state a `register()` call builds once and threads to every [ElementDefinition](ElementDefinition.md).\nIt carries the prefix-aware registry adapter, the `tag()` helper for nested markup, the CSS-class\nprefix `I`, the Invoker Commands support flag + router, the `wrapper`/`variantClass`/`iconSvg`\nfactories, and locale data (`strings`, `locale`, `dir`, `firstDay`)."
msgstr "Te āhua tūmatanui e hangaia ana e te karanga `register()` kotahi anake ka haere iho ki ia [ElementDefinition](ElementDefinition.md).\nKa kawe i te haumanu rēhita mō te kaitūpato ingoa, te awhina `tag()` mō te tohu pareikura, te tūāhua kāwai CSS\n`I`, te tūāpapa tautoko + kaiwhakarite mō ngā Invoker Commands, ngā wheketere `wrapper`/`variantClass`/`iconSvg`, me ngā raraunga rohe (`strings`, `locale`, `dir`, `firstDay`)."

