msgid "How the target is exposed:\n- `namespace` — re-exported into the eager barrel *and* as a subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — subpath imports the package's `/inject` entry; also in the barrel.\n- `subpath` — subpath only, kept OUT of the eager barrel (for heavy peers like React, so\n  `import \"pantoken\"` never loads them)."
msgstr "Me pēhea te whakapuaki i te whāinga:\n- `namespace` — ka tukuna anō (re-exported) ki te eager barrel *me* hei subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — ko te subpath e kawemai ana i te tomokanga `/inject` o te mōkī; kei roto anō hoki i te barrel.\n- `subpath` — subpath anake, kātahi ka whakakahore i roto i te eager barrel (mō hoa taumaha pērā i a React, kia kore ai e utaina e\n  `import \"pantoken\"`)."

