msgid "Stylesheet URLs the runner injects (into its chrome and every rendered result): the component\nsheets, the multi-theme token sheet, and the plugin/surface sheets. The runner themes by toggling\nthe `data-pantoken-theme` attribute, so one token sheet covers every theme."
msgstr "Ngā URL o ngā pepa kāhua e whakauruhia ana e te runner (ki tōna chrome me ia hua kua whakairo): ngā pepa wāhanga, te pepa token maha-ākau, me ngā pepa mō ngā taputapu/āhua mata. Ka whakahaerehia ngā kaupapa ā-rangi o te runner mā te whakawhiti i te āhuatanga `data-pantoken-theme`, nō reira kotahi te pepa token ka kapi i ngā kaupapa katoa."

