#: tools/demo/src/variables/FULLSCREEN_BUTTON_HTML.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: FULLSCREEN\\_BUTTON\\_HTML"
msgstr "# Taipūtī: FULLSCREEN\\_BUTTON\\_HTML"

#: tools/demo/src/variables/FULLSCREEN_BUTTON_HTML.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A hoverable \"view fullscreen\" button, overlaid on a demo/example frame the same way VitePress's own\ncode-block \"copy\" button reveals on hover. Purely markup — wire a delegated click handler in your\nhost page (`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; see the pantoken docs\ntheme for the reference wiring) and style the reveal-on-hover with `@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."
msgstr "He pātene ka puta i te pākina \"tiro i te mata-katoa\", ā, ka whakanohoia ki runga i te anga whakaaturanga/taurangi, i te āhua kotahi tonu e puta ai te pātene \"kōpia\" o VitePress i te wā e pākina ana. He tohu anake — honoia he kaiwhakahaere pāwhiri tohaina ki tō whārangi ū (`button.closest(...).querySelector(\"iframe\")?.requestFullscreen()`; tirohia te kaupapa tuhinga pantoken mō te taura tohutoro) ā, hoahoa te whakaaturanga-i-te-pākinana mā `@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."

