msgid "pantoken icon logo (current-color)."
msgstr "pantoken tohu ā-ikon (tae-ināianei)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken icon logo (dark)."
msgstr "pantoken tohu ā-ikon (pouri)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken icon logo (reversed)."
msgstr "pantoken tohu ā-ikon (huri)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The localized wordmark's language, if a translated variant is wanted."
msgstr "Te reo o te kupu tohu ā-rohe, mēnā e hiahiatia ana tētahi waahanga kua whakamaoritia."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The localized wordmark's language, absent for the default (English) variant."
msgstr "Te reo o te kupu tohu ā-rohe; kāore mō te rerekētanga taunoa (Ingarangi)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A trailing language code on a localized wordmark variant, e.g. `\"horizontal-full-color-ar\"`."
msgstr "He waehurihuri waehanga reo i te mutunga o tētahi rerekētanga o te tohu kupu ā-rohe, ā, hei tauira `\"horizontal-full-color-ar\"`."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag or a pre-built [LocaleBundle](#). When set, uses `registerLocalized`."
msgstr "Tapanga rohe BCP47, ranei he [LocaleBundle](#) kua oti te hanga. A, ka tohua, ka whakamahia `registerLocalized`."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](#) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](#) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Ka tango i tētahi [LocaleBundle](#) kua whakatau katoa *rānei* tētahi taura tapanga BCP47 mata. Mēnā ka tukuna he taura, ka whakaputa e [makeStrings](#) ngā ingoa rā o te wiki mā te whakamahi i `Intl.DateTimeFormat` ā, ka huri ngā atu kuputuhi ki te reo Pākehā; tukuna he bundle mō ngā whakamāoritanga katoa."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](#) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "He tūāpapa [LocaleBundle](#), rānei he tapanga BCP47 (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."

msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Defines the uniform plugin contract ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)) and adapts the resolved token IR for\nthe native lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md)). The upstream-resolving transform (`buildTokens`,\nwhich needs the GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`) lives on the separate\n`@pantoken/core/build` entry so this main entry stays free of that exotic dependency."
msgstr "Whakamāramahia te kirimana mono kotahi ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md))) me te whakarite i te IR token kua whakatau kia hāngai mō\nte rārangi taketake ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md))). Ko te hurihanga e whakatau ana i te puna tōmua (`buildTokens`,\nwhich needs the GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`)) e noho ana i runga i te tomokanga motuhake\n`@pantoken/core/build`, nō reira ka noho wātea tēnei tomokanga matua i taua whakawhirinaki tauhou."
